<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1 Kings</book>
  <para style="h">1 Kings</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Kings</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kings</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kings</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a lo upain, a lo tar ta hle a; tichuan, puanin an khuh ṭhîn a; nimahsela, a lum thei chuang hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, a puipaten a hnênah, “Kan pu lal tân hian nula i zawng teh ang u; lal bulah hian awm reng sela, enkawl rawh se; tin, i ângchhûngah hian lo mu sela, kan pu lal hi a lo lum thei dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel ram zawng zawngah chuan nula hmêl ṭha an zawng a, Sunam mi Abisagi an va hmu a, lal hnênah chuan an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu nula chu a hmêl a ṭha hle mai a; lal chu a enkawl a, a rawng a bâwlsak ṭhîn a; nimahsela, lal chuan a pâwl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Hagithi fapa Adonija chuan, “Keimah ka la lal dâwn hi maw,” tiin a inngai ropui hle mai a; tawlailîr leh sakawr chung chuang mite, mi sawmnga a hmaa tlân tûrte nên a buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pa lah chuan eng lai mahin, “Engati nge hetiangin i tih?” tiin a tilungni lo ngai si lo va; tin, amah chu hmêl ṭha tak a ni bawk a. Absaloma chhang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan Zeruii fapa Joaba leh puithiam Abiathara chu a râwn a; anni chu Adonija lamah an ṭang a, an ṭanpui ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Simeia te, Reia te leh Davida ho mi huaisente erawh chu Adonija lamah an ṭang ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Adonija chuan berâmte, sebâwngpate, ran châwm thaute Zohelet lungah a talh a, chu chu En-rogel bula awm a ni; tin, lal fapa, a unau zawng zawngte leh, Judai rama lal puipaho zawng zawngte chu a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zâwlnei Nathana te, Benaia te, mi huaisenhote leh a unaupa Solomona erawh chu a sâwm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Nathanan Solomona nu Bathsebi hnênah, “Hagithi fapa Adonija hi kan pu Davida hriat lohvin a lal ta mai tih i hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangma himna tûr leh i fapa Solomona himna tûr ka lo hrilh teh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal Davida hnênah va lût ta la, a hnênah, ‘Aw lalpa, ka pu, i bâwihnu hnênah hian, “I fapa Solomona hi ka hnuah a la lal ngei ngei dâwn a, amah hi ka lalṭhutthlêngah hian a la ṭhu dâwn e,” ti khân chhia i chham a ni lâwm ni kha? Engati nge Adonija lala a awm tâk mai?’ va ti teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, lal i va biak lai takin kei pawhin ka rawn zui lût ve mai ang chia, i thusawi chu ka rawn nemnghehpui dâwn che nia,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Bathsebi chu lal hnênah pindanah chuan a va lût a; lal chu a upa tawh hle mai a, Sunam mi Abisagi chuan lal rawng chu a bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Bathsebi chuan lal chu kûnin chibai a bûk a. Tin, lal chuan, “Eng nge i duh le?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka pu, Lalpa i Pathian hming chhâlin i bâwihnu hnênah hian, ‘I fapa Solomona hi ka hnuah a la lal ngei ngei dâwn a, amah hi ka lalṭhutthlêngah hian a la ṭhu dâwn e,’ ti khân chhia i chham tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai teh, hei Adonija a lal ta reng mai; nang, ka pu lalpa lah hian i hre ve si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bâwngpate, ran châwm thaute, berâmte a talh ṭeuh va, lal fapa zawng zawngte leh, puithiam Abiathara leh, sipai hotu Joaba te a sâwm a; i chhiahhlawh Solomona erawh chu a sâwm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, ka pu, lalpa hnuah hian a lalṭhutthlêngah tu nge la ṭhu dâwn tih i hrilh chângin Israel-ho zawng zawng mit hi nang, ka pu lalpa, i chungah a fu ṭhup a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuti lo zawng, heti hi a ni ang a, ka pu lalpa hi a puteho hnêna a muthilh ve hunah chuan, kei leh ka fapa Solomona hi thil tisualtuah min ruat mai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, chutia lal a biak lai tak chuan, zâwlnei Nathana chu a lo lût ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“En teh, zâwlnei Nathana a lo kal e,” tiin lal chu an hrilh a. Tin, lal kiang a va thlen chuan, lal hmaah chuan a hmaia lei siin a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Nathana chuan, “Aw lalpa, ka pu, ‘Ka hnuah Adonija hi a lal ang a, ka lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu ang,’ i ti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vawiinah hian a chhuk a, bâwngpate, ran châwm thaute, berâmte a talh ṭeuh mai a, lal fapa zawng zawngte, sipai hotute, puithiam Abiathara te a sâwm a; tin, ngai teh, an eiin an in ho va, ‘Pathianin Lal Adonija hi humhim rawh se,’ an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, kei i chhiahhlawh ngei leh, puithiam Zadoka leh, Jehoiada fapa Benaia leh, i chhiahhlawh Solomona hi zawng min sâwm ve lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hei hi lalpa ka pu thûa tih a nih si chuan, lalpa ka pu hian a hnua lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûra hi tu ber nge ni tih i chhiahhlawhte hi i lo la hrilh lo a ni ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Davida chuan a chhâng a, “Bathsebi mi han kohsak teh u,” a ti a. Tin, lal kiangah chuan a va kal a, lal hmaah a va ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan chhia a chham a, “Manganna zawng zawnga ka nunna humhimtu Lalpa nunna chhâlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />i hnêna Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hming chhâla, ‘I fapa Solomona hi ka hnuah chuan a lal ngei ngei ang, ka aiah ka lalṭhutthlêngah hian a la ṭhu dâwn e,’ tia chhia ka chham ang ngei khân, vawiin ngeiah pawh hian ka la ti dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Bathsebi chu a hmaia lei siin a bawkkhup a, lal chu chibai a bûk a, “Ka pu Lal Davida hi kumkhuain dam reng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Lal Davidan, “Puithiam Zadoka leh, zâwlnei Nathana leh Jehoiada fapa Benaia mi va koh teh u,” a ti a. Tin, a hmaah chuan an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan an hnênah, “In pu puipate hruai ula, ka fapa Solomona hi keima sabengtung ngei chungah chuantîr ula, Gihon hmunah zuk hruai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Zadoka leh zâwlnei Nathanan Israel-te lal atân hriak zuk thih rawh se; tin, tawtawrâwt hâm ula, ‘Pathianin Lal Solomona humhim rawh se,’ ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, amah chu in zui chho vang a, ka lalṭhutthlêngah hian a lo ṭhu dâwn nia, amah hi ka aia lal tûr a ni si a; tin, amah hi Israel ram leh Judai ram hotu atân ka ruat a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan lal chu a chhâng a, “Amen! Lalpa , ka pu Lalpa Pathian pawhin remti ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka pu lalpa hnêna a awm ṭhîn angin, Solomona hnênah pawh awm ve zêl sela, ka pu Lal Davida lalṭhutthlêng aiin a lalṭhutthlêng chu tiropui zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam Zadoka te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te, Kereth mite, Peleth mite chu an zuk kal a, Solomona chu Davida sabengtung chungah an chuantîr a, Gihon hmunah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Zadoka chuan Puan In ata hriak dahna ki a la a, Solomona chu a thih ta a. Tin, tawtawrâwt an hâm a; tichuan, mi zawng zawngin, “Pathianin Lal Solomona humhim rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho zawng zawng chuan amah chu an zui chho va, mipuite chuan phênglâwngte an tum a, an lâwm nasa khawp a, an thâwm ri chuan lei a nghawr khi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Adonija leh a sâwmho a hnêna awm zawng zawngte chuan an ruaiṭheh zawh chuan an han hria a. Tin, Joaban tawtawrâwt ham rîk a han hriat chuan, “Khawpui chhûnga thâwm ri awm ta dur dur chu eng tizia nge maw ni chu le?” a ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutia a tih lai tak chuan ngai teh, puithiam Abiathara fapa Jonathana a va kal a. Adonija chuan, “Lo kal teh khai, nang zawng mi fel i ni a, Chanchin Ṭha i rawn thlen châwk ang chu maw?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Jonathanan a chhâng a, Adonija hnênah chuan, “Thlen lo ve! Kan pu, Lal Davidan Solomona lalah a siam ta alâwm maw le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama rualin puithiam Zadoka te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te, Kereth mite, Peleth mite lalin a tîr a; lal sabengtung chungah an chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Zadoka leh zâwlnei Nathanan Gihon hmunah lal atân hriak an thih ta a; chuta ṭang chuan hlim takin an lo chho va, chu chuan khawpui chhûng a khâwk rum rum a ni. Chu chu a ni in thâwm hriat chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chu ram lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhu ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, lal puipate chu, ‘I Pathianin i hming aiin Solomona hming chu tiṭha zâwk sela, i lalṭhutthlêng aiin a lalṭhutthlêng chu tiropui zâwk rawh se,’ tia kan pu Lal Davida lawmpui tûrin an kal chiam bawk a; tin, lal chu khum siin a kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, lal pawh chuan heti hian a ti, ‘ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, vawiin ngeia ka lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr rawn ruattu chu fakin awm rawh se, ka mit ngeiin a hmuh tâk hi,’ a ti bawk a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Adonija mi sâwmte zawng zawng chuan an hlau ta a, an tho va, mahni kawng kawngah an kal ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Adonija chuan Solomona chu a hlau ta a; a tho va, maichâm ki a va vuan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, “Ngai teh, Adonijan Lal Solomona a hlau va; ‘Lal Solomona hian a chhiahhlawh hi khandaiha tihlum lo tûrin ka hnênah chhia chham phawt rawh se,’ tiin maichâm ki a vuan e,” tiin Solomona chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan, “Mi rinawm tak a nih a tihlan phawt chuan a sam zai khat pawh leiah a tla lo vang; amaherawhchu, suahsualna a nei tih hriatna a awm chuan a thi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Solomona chuan mi a tîr a, maichâm ata chu an va hruai thla a. Tin, a va kal a, Lal Solomona chu chibai a bûk a; tin, Solomona chuan a hnênah, “I inah haw tawh,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida thih hun chu a lo hnai ta a, a fapa Solomona chu thu a pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leilung zawng zawng dân angin ka kal ve dâwn ta a ni; tichuan, chak takin awm la, patling takin awm rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />i thiltih apiang leh, i hawina lam apianga i hmuingîl theih nân Mosia Dâna ziak anga Lalpa i Pathianin a kawngte zawh tûr leh, a thuruat te, a thupêk te, a rorêl te leh a thuhriattîrte pawm tûra thu a pêkte hi zâwm rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan ka chungchâng thûa, ‘I thlahten an thinlung tak leh an rilru taka ka mit hmuha thutaka awm tûra an awm dâna an fimkhur chuan, Israel-te lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr i hmai lo vang,’ tia a sawi kha a tinghet dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Zeruii fapa Joaba mi tih zia, Israel-te sipai hotu pahnih, Nera fapa Abnera leh Jethera fapa Amasa-te a tih zia ngei kha i hria e. Khatia a thaha, inrem laia indo thisen chhuaha a chhuaha, a taia kâwnghrênah leh a pheikhawk buna indo thisen a tihkai ziate kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, i remhriat dân angin ti langin, a lua kêlsam ṭo hi thlânah thlamuang takin liamtîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead mi Barzilaia fate chungah erawh chuan khawngaihna lantîr langin, i dawhkâna chaw kîltuah teltîr ve ang che, i unau Absaloma laka ka tlân bo lai khân ka hnênah an lo kal si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Bahurim khuaa mi Benjamina thlah, Gera fapa Simeia hi i hnênah a awm a, ani chuan Mahanaim hmuna ka kal lai khân ânchhe ṭha lo tak mi lawh a; amaherawhchu, Jordan-ah mi hmuak tûrin a lo chhuk a, chutah chuan, ‘Khandaihin ka that lo vang che,’ tiin Lalpa hming chhâlin a hnênah chhia ka lo chham tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, thiam chang zawngin chhuah suh, mi fing i ni si, a chungah engtia tih tûr nge ni tih zawng i hre mai ang a; a lua kêlsam ṭo chu thisen nên thlânah i liamtîr dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a puteho hnênah a muhîl ve ta a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel-hote chunga Davida lal chhûng chu kum sawmli a ni: Hebron khuaah kum sarih a lal a, Jerusalem khuaah kum sawmthum leh kum thum a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chu a pa Davida lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhu a; tichuan, a ram chu nasa taka tihnghehin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Hagithi fapa Adonija chu Solomona nu Bathsebi hnênah a kal a. Ani chuan, “Ṭha lam thûa lo kal em i nih le?” a ti a. Anin, “Ṭha lam thûah ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, “I hnênah eng emaw sawi tûr ka nei a ni,” a ti leh a. Ani chuan, “Sawi ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ram hi ka ta a ni tawh tih leh, Israel-ho zawng zawngte pawh hian keimah hi lal atân mi thlîr reng a ni tih i hria a. Nimahsela, ram chu ka unaupa tân a lo inlet leh ta zâwk a; Lalpa lo ruat dânah a ta a ni rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah hian thil pakhat dîl tûr che ka nei a, mi remtih lohsak lul suh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Sawi ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Khawngaih takin Lal Solomona mi biaksak la (i thu zawng a hnial âwm si lo va), Sunam mi Abisagi hi nupuiah mi neihtîr rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Bathsebi chuan, “Aw le, lal chu ka lo biaksak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Bathsebi chu Adonija biaksak tûrin Lal Solomona hnênah chuan a kal ta a. Tin, lal chu amah lâwm tûrin a tho va, a hmaah a kûn a, a lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhu a; tin, lal nu tân chuan lalṭhutthlêng a hûntîr a; a ding lamah chuan a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, “Thil pakhat tê tak tê ka dîl dâwn che a ni; min remtih lohsak lul suh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “Dîl ta che, ka nu, ka remtih lohsak hauh lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Sunam mi Abisagi hi i unaupa Adonija nupui atân neihtîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chuan a chhâng a, a nu hnênah chuan, “Engtiziaa Sunam mi Abisagi hi Adonija tâna dîl nge maw i nih le? Ram pawh hi dîlsak ta nghâl law law che, ani chu ka u a ni alâwm; ama tân leh puithiam Abiathara leh Zeruii fapa Joaba tân pawh chuan dîl ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Solomona chuan Lalpa hming chhâlin, “Adonija thil dîl hian ama chunga thihna thu sawi a niha a nih loh nâ chuan Pathianin a tih tihin mi ti mai sela, chu aia nasa pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa , a thutiam anga mi tingheta, ka pa Davida lalṭhutthlênga mi ṭhuttîra, chhûngkua mi lo dinsaktu nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Adonija hi vawiin ni la la hian tihhlum ngei ngei tûr a ni,” tiin chhia a chham ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Solomona chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu a tîr a; ani chuan a va bei a, a that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Abiathara hnênah chuan lalin, “Anathoth khuaah nangma in leh lovah haw daih tawh, thi mai tlâk zawng i ni a; nimahsela, ka pa Davida hmaa Lalpa Pathian bâwm i lo zâwn ṭhin avâng leh, ka pa hrehawm tuarna zawng zawngahte chuan i lo tuar ve tawh ṭhin avângin tûnah zawng ka tihlum rih lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan Abiathara chu Lalpa puithiam a nihna a bân ta a; Lalpan Silo khuaa Elia chhûngte chungchâng thu a sawi kha a thlentîr theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chumi thu chu Joaban a lo hria a; Joaba chu Absaloma lamah khân a ṭang lo na a, Adonija lama ṭang a ni si a. Tichuan, Joaba chu Lalpa puan inah a tlân a, maichâm kite chu a vuan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, “ Lalpa puan inah Joaba a tlân a; ngai teh, maichâm bulah a awm,” tiin Lal Solomona chu an hrilh a. Tichuan, Lal Solomona chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu, “Han bei tawh,” tiin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Benaia chu Lalpa puan inah a han kal a, a hnênah chuan, “Lalin, ‘Lo chhuak rawh se,’ a ti e,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ni lo ve; hetah hian ka thi mai ang e,” a ti a. Tin, Benaia chuan, “Joaban hetiang hian a lo ti a, hetiang hian mi lo chhâng a ni,” tiin lal hnênah thu a thlen leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a hnênah, “A sawi ang chuan han ti la, han bei la, phûm rawh; a chhan awm hauh lova Joaban thisen a chhuah lak ata kha kei leh ka pa chhûngte hi i tihfihlîm theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, amah aia mi fel zâwk leh ṭha zâwk mi pahnih - Nera fapa Abnera, Israel-te sipai hotu leh Jethera fapa Amasa, Juda-te sipai hotu kha ka pa Davida hriat loh va a beiha, khandaiha a thah avângin Lalpan a thisen chu ama lû chungah ngei a rawn lêttîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, an thisen chu Joaba lû chungah leh a thlahte lu chungah kumkhuain a lêt ang a; Davida chungah te, a thlahte chungah te, a chhûngte chungah te, a lalṭhutthlêng chungah te erawh chuan Lalpa hnên aṭanga thlamuanna kumkhuain a awm reng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu a han chho va, a han bei a, a that ta a; tin, thlalêra ama inah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, lalin Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu sipaihote chungah a ai a awhtîr a; tin, puithiam Zadoka chu lalin Abiathara ai a awhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, lalin Simeia chu a kohtîr a, a hnênah, “Jerusalem-ah hian in sa la, chutah chuan awm la, chuta ta chu khawi dangah mah chhuak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I chhuah ni, Kidron lui i kân ni la la chuan i thi ngei ngei ang tih hre rawh khai; i thisen chu nangma lû chungah ngei a awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Simeia chuan lal hnênah, “A dik alâwm; lalpa ka puin a sawi ang chuan i chhiahhlawhin a ti zêl ang,” a ti a. Tin, Simeia chu Jerusalem-ah chuan rei fe chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum thum a lo vei hnu chuan Simeia chhiahhlawhte zînga pahnih chu Gath khaw lal Maaka fapa Akisa hnênah an tlân a. Tin, “Ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhte chu Gath khuaah an awm e,” tiin Simeia chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Simeia chu a tho va, a sabengtung a thuam a, a chhiahhlawhte zawng tûrin Gath khuaah Akisa hnênah chuan a kal ta a; tin, Simeia chuan Gath khua ata a chhiahhlawhte chu a va hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Simeia chu Jerusalem khua ata a chhuak a, Gath khuaah a va kal a, a lo haw leh tih Solomona chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Simeia chu a kohtîr a, a hnênah, “ ‘I chhuah ni, ram danga i chhuah ni la la chuan i thi ngei ngei ang,’ ti khân Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia ka chhamtîr chein, ka hriattîr che a ni lâwm ni? Tin, nang pawhin ka hnênah khân, ‘I thusawi ka hriat hi a ṭha e,’ i tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Eng vânga Lalpa chhechham leh thu ka pêk che kha hlen lo nge i nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, lal vêk chuan Simeia hnênah, “I thinlung chhûngril suahsualzia, ka pa Davida chunga i tih zia te kha i hre vek a; chutichuan, Lalpan i suahsualna hi nangma lû chungah ngei a rawn lêttîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lal Solomona erawh chu malsâwmin a awm ang a, Davida lalṭhutthlêng chu Lalpa hmaa kumkhuaa tihngheh a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu thu a pe a; ani chu a chhuak a, Simeia chu a va bei a, a that ta a. Tichuan, ram chu Solomona kutah tihnghehin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Solomonan Aigupta lal Pharaoa nêna inkûngkaihna a siam a, Pharaoa fanu a nei a; ama in leh Lalpa in a sak hma leh, Jerusalem khua kulha a hung vêl hma loh chuan Davida khawpuiah a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipuihote chu hmun sângahte an inthawi mai ṭhîn a, chumi hma chuan Lalpa hming atân in sak a la awm rih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomona chuan Lalpa chu a hmangaih a, a pa Davida thuruatte chu a zâwm ṭhîn a; hmun sângahte a inthawi a, rimtuite a hâl mai ṭhîn pawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, lal chu inthawi tûrin Gibeon khuaah a kal a, chu chu hmun sâng pawimawh taka chu a ni si a; Solomona chuan chumi maichâm chungah chuan hâlral thilhlan sângkhat zet a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Gibeon khuaah chuan Lalpa chu Solomona hnênah zânah a mumangah a rawn inlâr a; tin, Pathianin, “Dîl teh, eng nge ka pêk ang che?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan, “I chhiahhlawh ka pa Davida kha i mit hmuha thutakah leh, felnaah leh, thinlung dik tak pua a awm ang zêl khân nang chuan a hnênah khawngaihna nasa tak i lantîr a; nangin he khawngaihna nasa tak hi a tân i vohsak a, nangin a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr fapa i pe a, vawiina a lo awm ta ngei ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, aw Lalpa ka Pathian, nangin i chhiahhlawh hi ka pa Davida aiah chuan lalah i lo siam ta a; kei zawng naupangchhia mai ka ni a, thu haw lam leh kal lam pawh hi ka la hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hi i mite i thlanho, mi tam tak, an tam avânga chhiar sên rual loh leh, a zât hriat sên rual lohte zîngah hian a awm a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, i mite rorêlsakna tûrin i chhiahhlawh hi hriatna thinlung pe ang che, a chhia leh a ṭha ka thliar theih nân. I mi heti zozai hi tuin nge rorêlsak thei ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Solomonan chu thil chu a dîl avângin, chu thusawi chuan Lalpa a tilâwm hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin a hnênah, “Nangin i tân dam reina dîl lova, hetiang hi i dîl zâwk avâng leh, i tân hausaknate pawh dîl lova, i hmêlmate thihna pawh dîl lova, i tân rorêl thiamna i dîl zâwk avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ngai teh, i dîl ang chuan ka ti ta a; ngai teh, finna leh hriatna thinlung ka pe a che; tichuan, i hmaah nangmah ang rêng rêng tu mah an awm lo va, i hnuah pawh nangmah ang rêng rêng tu mah an awm tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, i dîl loh, hausakna leh ropuina pawh ka pe bawk a che; tichuan, i dam chhûngin lal zîngah chuan nangmah ang rêng rêng an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I pa Davidan a zawh anga ka thuruatte leh ka thupêkte pawm tûra ka kawngte i zawh chuan ka dam reitîr bawk ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chu a han harh a; ngai teh, mumang a lo ni a. Tin, Jerusalem-ah a kal a, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm hmaah a ding a, hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlante a hlân a, a puipa zawng zawngte tân ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmeichhe pahnih, nawhchizuar hi lal hnênah chuan an kal a, a hmaah an han ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe pakhat chuan, “Aw ka pu, he hmeichhia nên hian in khata chêng dûn kan ni a; chumi ina a awm ve lai chuan nau ka hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ka nau hrin achin ni thum hnuah chuan he hmeichhia pawh hian a hring ve a. Awm dûn kan ni a; chu ina awm keimahni pahnih ngawt lo chu, chu inah chuan tu mah mikhual awm an awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, he hmeichhe fa hi zânah a lo thi a; a delh hlum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, zanlaiah a tho va, i bâwihnu hi a muthilh hlânin, ka fapa, ka bula mi chu a la a, a pawm a, a fa thia chu mi pawmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tûk zînga ka fa hnute pe tûra ka han thawh chuan, ngai teh, a thi a lo ni reng mai a; nimahsela, zînga ka han en chian chuan, ngai teh, ka fapa, ka hrina kha a lo ni hauh lo mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe dang chuan, “Ni lo, a dam zâwka hi ka fapa a ni a, a thia hi i fapa a ni,” a ti ve a. Pakhat chuan, “Ni lo, a thia hi i fapa a ni a, a dama hi ka fapa a ni zâwk,” a la ti tlat bawk a. Chutiang chuan lal hmaah chuan an sawi ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan, “Pakhatin, ‘A dam zâwka hi ka fapa a ni a, a thia hi i fapa a ni,’ a ti a; tin, pakhatin, ‘Ni lo, a thia hi i fapa a ni a, a dama hi ka fapa a ni zâwk,’ a ti bawk si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Khandaih mi han lâk teh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, khandaih chu lal hmaah chuan an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, “Naute dama kha bung hnihah chhuah ula, a chanve chu pakhat kha pe ula, a chanve chu pakhat kha pe rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, naute dama nu chuan a fa chu a lainat êm êm mai si a, lal hnênah chuan, “Aw ka pu, naute dama hi amah pe mai rawh, a thah zawng that lul suh ang che,” a ti a. Pakhat zâwk erawh chuan, “Ka ta ni bîk hek suh, i ta ni bîk hek suh; bung mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan a chhâng a, “Naute dama kha pe rawh u, that hlek suh u; amah ngei kha a nu a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan chu thûa lal rêl dân chu an lo hria a, lal chu an ṭih ta hle mai a; rorêlna tûrin Pathian finna chu amahah chuan a awm tih an hre ta si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chu Israel-ho zawng zawng lalah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêngte hi a mi lianho neihte chu an ni: Zadoka fapa Azaria chu puithiam a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sisa fapa, Elihorepha leh Ahija-te chu lehkhaziaktu an ni a; Ahiluda fapa Jehosaphata chu chanchin ziaktu a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu sipai hotu a ni a; Zadoka leh Abiathara chu puithiam an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nathana fapa Azaria chu hotute chunga mi a ni a; Nathana fapa Zabuda chu puithiam leh lal ṭhian a ni fâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahisara chu in chhûng lam hotu a ni a; Abda fapa Adonirama chu hnathawka rawih luihte hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Israel-ho zawng zawng chungah chuan hotu sâwm leh pahnih a nei a, chûngho chuan lal tân leh a chhûngkuate tân chuan ei tûr an ngaihtuah ṭhîn a; mi pakhatin kum khatah thla khat zêl ei tûr a ngaihtuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêngte hi an hmingte chu a ni: Ephraim tlâng ramah Ben-hura;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Makaz khuaah te, Saalbim khuaah te, Beth-semes khuaah te, Elon-beth-hanan khuaah te Ben-dekera;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aruboth ramah Ben-heseda; ani chuan Soko leh Hepher ram zawng zawng a chang tel a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dor khaw zosang ram zawng zawngah Ben-abinadaba; ani chuan Solomona fanu Taphathi nupuiah a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taanak khua leh Meggido khuaah te, Jezreel khaw hnuai, Zarethan khaw bula awm Beth-san bial zawng zawngah te, Beth-san aṭanga Abel-mehola-ah te, Jokneam ram dep thlengin Ahiluda fapa Baana;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ramoth-gilead khuaah Ben-gebera; ani chuan Manasea fapa Jaira khua, Gilead rama awmte chu a chang tel a; Basan rama Argob bial, khaw ropui tak tak khaw sawmruk, kulh leh a kalhna dâr tlâwn neite pawh a chang tel a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahanaim khuaah Idova fapa Ahinadaba;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali ramah Ahimaaza; ani pawh chuan Solomona fanu Basemathi nupuiah a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aser leh Bealoth khuaahte Husaia fapa Baana;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isakar ramah Parua fapa Jehosaphata;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin raman Ela fapa Simeia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor-ho lal Sihona leh Basan lal Oga ram, Gilead ramah Uria fapa Gebera; chu ramah chuan hotu pakhat a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Juda-te leh Israel-te chu tuifinriat kama ṭiau vaivut zât zetin an tam a, an eiin an in a, hlim takin an awm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomona chuan Lui aṭangin Philistia-ho ram leh Aigupta ramri thlengin ram zawng zawng chungah chuan ro a rêl a. Lâwmmante an rawn keng ṭhîn a, Solomona dam chhûng zawng chuan a rawng an bâwl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomona ni khat ei tâwk chu chhangphut dip tak tehkhâwng sawmthum leh, chhangphut tehkhâwng sawmruk a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />bâwngpa thau tak sâwm te, bâwngpa tla mi sawmhnih te, berâm za te nên; chûng lo pawh chu sakhi te, sangai te, sakhipa te, âr châwm thaute pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lui râl piah lam ram zawng zawng - Tipsa aṭanga Gaza thlengin, Lui ral piah lama lalho zawng zawng chungah chuan a lal a; a chheh vêla mi zawng zawngte nên chuan râlmuangin an awm hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Solomona dam chhûng zawng chuan Juda-ho leh Israel-ho chu, Dan aṭanga Beer-seba khaw thlengin, mi tin mahni grêp hrui bulah leh mahni theipui bulah chuan thlamuang takin an awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan a tawlailîr hnûktu sakawr in sîngli leh sakawr chung chuang mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng hotute chuan mahni chan thla zêlah, Lal Solomona leh Lal Solomona dawhkâna rawn kîl vetu zawng zawngte ei tûr chu an ngaihtuah ṭhîn a; pêk kim loh an nei ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi tinin an tih tûra ruat ang zêlin a awmna tûr hmunah chuan, sakawrte leh ran tlân chak takte tân barli leh buhpâwlte an rawn dah bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Solomona chu finna leh hriatna nasa tak leh, rilru zauna, tuifinriat kama ṭiau vaivut ang mai a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomona finna chuan khawchhak fate zawng zawng finna leh Aigupta mite finna zawng zawng chu a khûm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng aiin a fing a ni: Mahola fate - Ezra mi Ethana te, Hemana te, Kalkola te, Darda te ai pawhin; tichuan, a vêl hnam zawng zawngte zîngah chuan a hming a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thufing sângthum a sawi a; tin, a hlate chu sângkhat leh panga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thing chanchin te pawh Lebanon tlânga sidar thing aṭanga kulha lo chawr chhuak husop chenin a sawi ṭhîn a; sa chanchin te, bawkvâka kal chi chanchin te, sangha chanchin te pawh a sawi ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomona finna chanchin hre tawh phawt chu, khawvêl lalho zawng zawng aṭangin, chi tina mi a finna ngaithla tûr an lo kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Tura lal Hiraman Solomona hnênah a mite a tîr a, a pa aiah lal atân hriak an thih tih a lo hre ta si a; Hirama chu Davida ngaina ṭhîntu a ni fo rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Hirama hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa Davida khân Lalpan a kephah hnuaia a dah hma loh kha chuan a vêl kil tin kil tanga indonate avâng khân, Lalpa a Pathian hming atân in a sa thei lo tih i hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan Lalpa ka Pathianin kil tin kil tangah muanna min lo neihtîr ta a; hmêlmate an awm ta lo va, vânduaina pawh a awm ta hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Lalpan ka pa Davida hnêna, ‘I fapa, i aia i lalṭhutthlêng ka la luahtîr tûra chuan ka hming atân in chu a la sa ang,’ tia a lo sawi tawh ang khân, Lalpa ka Pathian hming atân in sak ka tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lebanon tlânga mi sidar thingte mi kihsak tûrin thu pe langin, ka chhiahhlawhte pawh i chhiahhlawhte zîngah an tel ve ang a; tin, i chhiahhlawhte hlawh chu i sawi ang apiang ka pe zêl ang che; Zidon mite anga thing kih thiam kan zîngah tu mah an awm lo tih i hre si,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Hiraman Solomona thu a lo hriat chuan a lâwm ta êm êm mai a, “Hêng mi tam tak chunga rorêl tûra fapa fing tak Davida petu Lalpa chu vawiinah hian fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hiraman Solomona hnênah, “I thu mi han chah chu ka lo hria a; sidar thing thu leh fâr thing thu chu i mamawh apiang ka lo ti ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawhten Lebanon tlâng aṭangin tuifinriat thlengin an rawn la thla ang a; i hmun mi ruatsak tûra tuifinriata tawlh tûrin ka têltîr ang a, chumi hmunah chuan ka phelhtîr ang a, nangin i lo la dâwn nia; tin, nang pawhin ka chhûngkuate ei tûr tumin ka mamawh i lo phuhru ve thung a ni ang chu,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hirama chuan sidar thing leh fâr thing chu Solomona hnênah a mamawh apiang a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Solomonan Hirama chu a chhûngkuate ei atân buh tehkhâwng sînghnih leh hriak sâwr tehkhâwng sawmhnih a pe a. Chu chu Solomonan kum tina Hirama a pêk ṭhin dân chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a tiam ang ngeiin Solomona chu finna a pe a; tin, Hirama leh Solomona kârah chuan inremna a awm a, an pahnih chuan thu an thlung dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chuan Israel-ho zawng zawng zînga mi hnathawka rawih luih pâwl a siam a; rawih luih pâwl chu mi sîngthum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon-ah chuan thla khata inthlâk zêlin sîngkhat a tîr ṭhîn a: thla khat Lebanon-ah an han awm a, thla hnih anmahni in lamah; Adonirama chu hnathawka rawih luihte hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan thil phur mi sîngsarih leh, lung chhêr mi sîngriat tlângahte a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chûngte chu tiam lovin Solomona chuan a hna chunga hotu bîk, hnathawk vêngtu sângthum leh zathum a nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, lal thupêkin in lungphûm chu lung chher saa rem tûrin lung lian pui pui, lung man tam tak takte an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, in satuho, Solomona mite leh Hirama mite leh Gebal mite chuan lungte chu an chher a, in sakna tûr chuan thing leh lungte chu an buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata an chhuah achin kum zali leh sawmriatna kum, Israel-hote chunga Solomona a lal kum lina, Ziv thla, thla hnihnaah chuan Lalpa in sak chu a ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Solomonan Lalpa tâna in a sak chu a dung lam tawng sawmruk a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chumi ina hmun thianghlim hma lama hulhliap chu a in vâng lam chen, tawng sawmhniha sei a ni a, a hma lama mi vâng lam chu tawng sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, in atân chuan tukverh zîm tê thil kawkalh awmin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a in bang vêlin, biak in bang vêlah pawh, biakna hmun bang vêlah pawh chumi in bang si chuan in chhâwng nei a sa a; tin, a vêl chuan pindan a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A chhâwng hnuaihnung ber chu a vâng lam tawng nga a ni a, a laita chu a vâng lam tawng ruk a ni a, a pathumna chu a vâng lam tawng sarih a ni; kalkhangte chu in banga inrawlh ngai lovin pâwn lamah chuan a vêlin in bangah chuan a nghahna a siam vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, in chu, an sak lai chuan lung a laihna hmuna chher sa veka sak a ni; tichuan, an sak chhûng zawng chu tuboh ri te, hreipui ri te, thîr hriamhrei ri rêng rêngte chumi inah chuan hriat a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pindan laita berte kawngka chu chumi in ding lampangah chuan a awm a. A laitaah chuan rahka vialah an lâwn chho va; tin, a laita aṭang chuan a pathumnaah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, in chu a han sa a, a zo ta a; in chu sidar khanchhuk leh a phêkin a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, in chhâwng neite chu a in si vekin tawng nga ṭheuhva sângin a sa a; chûngte chu in nên chuan sidar thinga zawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Solomona hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“He in i sak lai mêk chungchâng thu hi - ka thuruatte i pawma, ka rorêlte i zawma, ka thupêk zawng zawngte zâwm tûra i pawm phawt zawngin, i pa Davida hnêna ka lo sawi tawh, ka thu kha i chungah hian ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte zîngah hian ka chêng ang a, ka mi Israel-hote hi ka thlahthlam lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomona chuan in chu a sa a, a zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In chhûng lam bangah chuan sidar thing phel a hmang a; a chhuat aṭanga chung lam thlengin a chhûng lamah chuan thing a bel vek a; a chhuatah chuan fâr thing phel a phah belh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, kawmchâr lam tawng sawmhnih chu a chhuat aṭanga a bangte chenin sidar thing phel vekin a siam a; biakna hmun, hmun thianghlim ber atân pawh a chhûng lamah chuan a hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, in, biakna hmun bula biak in chu a dung lam tawng sawmli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, in chhûng lamah chuan a kuhmûm leh a pâr parh lema ker mawi sidar thing a awm a. A vai chuan sidar thing vek a ni a; lung rêng rêng a lang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm dahna tûrin chumi inah a chhûnga biakna lamah chuan hmun a buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chumi biakna hmun chhûng chu a dung lam tawng sawmhnih, a vâng lam tawng sawmhnih, a sân lam tawng sawmhnih a ni a. Chu chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a; tin, sidar maichâm chu a luan bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan chumi in chhûng chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a. Pindan chhûngril ber luhna kawngkaah chuan rangkachak khaidiat a thlung a, rangkachakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, in chu a zaa a peih thlengin a pumin rangkachak tîin a luan zêl a; biakna hmuna maichâm pum pui pawh chu rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, biakna hmunah chuan tawng sâwm ve vea sâng, cherub pahnih olive thingin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, cherub thla pakhat chu tawng nga a ni a, cherub thla lehlam chu tawng nga bawk a ni: thla pakhat hmâwr aṭanga a thla lehlam hmâwr inkâr chu tawng sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cherub pakhat pawh chu tawng sâwm a ni a; cherub-te chu intiat chiah leh pian dân inang ve ve chiah an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cherub pakhat sân zâwng chu tawng sâwm a ni a, cherub pakhat pawh chu chumi chen bawk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, cherub-te chu in chhûngril zâwkan chuan a dah a; tin, cherub-te thla chu a inzâr a, pakhat thla chuan bang lehlam a va dek a, cherub pakhat thla pawhin bang lehlam chu a dek bawk a. Chumi in lai takah chuan an thla leh an thla chu a insi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, cherub-te chu rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, in bang zawng zawngte chu a vêlin cherub te, tûm thing leh pangpâr parh lem ker mawite in chhûng lam leh pâwn lamah chuan a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a in chhuat chu chhûng lam leh pâwn lamah rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, biakna hmun luhna atân olive thing kawngkhâr a siam a; kawngka lû chung leh kawngka biangte chu a bang hmun ngaa ṭhena hmun khat tiat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, olive thingin kawngkhâr pahnih a siam a; chumiah chuan cherub-te, tûm thing leh pangpâr parh lemte ker mawiin a siam a, chûng chu rangkachak tîin a luan a; tin, cherub-te leh tûm thingte chu rangkachak a hnawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, biak in luhna atân a bang hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat tiatin olive thing kawngka ban a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Fâr thingin kawngkhâr pahnih a siam bawk a; kawngkhâr pakhata phêk hnih chu thlep thei a ni a, kawngkhâr pakhata phêk hnih pawh chu thlep thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chûngahte chuan cherub-te, tûm thing leh pangpâr parh lemte a ker a; chûng ker mawi chu mâm takin rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Biak in hung chhûng kawtlai chhûngril zâwk chu lung chher chhâwng thum leh sidar thing phel thuah khatin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A kum lina, Ziv thlaah chuan Lalpa in lungphûm chu rem a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, kum sâwm leh kum khatna, Bul thla, thla riatnaah chuan in chu ruahman ang chiahin a engkim chu peih vek a ni a. Chutichuan, kum sarih a sa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan ama in chu kum sâwm leh kum thum a sa a, a in chu a peih vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lebanon Ngawpui In sidar ban tlar li, ban chunga sidar thing phel chungah chuan a sa bawk a; a dung lam chu tawng za a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chu chu bana innghat pindan sawmli leh panga chung lamah chuan sidar thing phela khuh a ni a; tlar khatah chuan sâwm leh panga zêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, tlar thumin tukverh a awm a, êng leh êngte chu tlar thumin a inep vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, kawngkhâr leh ban zawng zawngte chu thing phelin kil lia siam a ni a; êng leh êngte chu tlar thumin a inep vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hulhliap chu ban neiin a siam a: a dung lam chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmthum a ni a; tin, chûng hmaahte chuan hulhliap a siam a, bante leh a hmaa luhna kailâwnte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a rorêlna tûr lalṭhutthlêng hulhliap, rorêlna hulhliap chu a siam bawk a; chu chu chhuat lehlam aṭanga a lehlam thlenga sidar thinga khuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a awmna tûr in, hulhliap chhûng, hung chhûng kawtlai danga awm chu chutiang bawka siam a ni. Pharaoa fanu (Solomonan nupuia a neih) chu hulhliap ang bawk chuan a in a saksak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu lung man tam tak tak, lung a tâwk chiah zêla chher, zainaa zaia sak a ni a, chhûng lam pawh, pâwn lam pawh a lungphûm aṭanga a lêr thlengin; tin, chutiang bawkin pâwn lamah hung chhûng kawtlai zau tak thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lungphûm chu lung man tam tak tak, lung lian pui pui, lung tawng sâwm te, lung tawng riat tea rem a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi chung lam chu lung man tam tak tak, lung a tâwk chiah zêla chher, leh sidar thing a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a vêlin hung chhûng kawtlai zau tak chu lung chher chhâwng thum leh sidar thing phel thuah khata hung a ni a; Lalpa in hung chhûng kawtlai chhûngril zâwk leh, in hulhliap ang bawk khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chuan mi a tîr a, Tura khua ata Hirama a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu mi chu Naphtali hnam hmeithai fa a ni a, a pa chu Tura khuaa mi, dâr chher mi a ni; ani chu dâr chher kawngah rêng rêng chuan a fingin a hre thiamin a themthiam hle mai a. Lal Solomona hnênah chuan a kal a, hna zawng zawng chu a thawhsak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, dâr ban pahnih a siam a, tawng sâwm leh tawng riata sâng ve ve, teh kuala tawng sâwm leh tawng hnih ve ve a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ban chhîpa dah tûr dâr chhûn bâwk pahnih a siam a: bâwk pakhat sân lam chu tawng nga a ni a, bâwk pakhat sân lam pawh chu tawng nga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ban chhîpa bâwk atân te chuan ṭial chik chek leh herh chîn chiante hi a awm a; bâwk pakhat atân chuan pasarih, bâwk dang pakhat atân pawh chuan pasarih bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, bante chu a siam a; chûng ban chhîpa bâwkte tuamna tûr chuan ṭial chik chek pakhat chungah a vêlin tlar hnih a awm a; tin, chutiang bawk chuan bâwk pakhat chungah pawh a awmtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hulhliap chhîpa bâwkah chuan lili lem hi a chuang a, tawng li a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ban pahnih chhîpa bâwkahte chuan a tlângah, ṭial chik chek bul lawkah chuan pawmgranet te a awm bawk a; tin, pawmgranet chu chumi bâwkahte chuan zahnih ve ve a tlarin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biak in hulhliapah chuan bante chu a dintîr a; ding lam ban chu a dintîr a, a hmingah Jakin a vuah a; tin, vei lam ban chu a dintîr a, a hmingah Boaz a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ban chhîpah chuan lili lem a chuang a; tichuan, ban lam hna chu peih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, dâr tuizêm lian pui, tawng sâwm tla, a sân lam tawng nga a chhûng a, a tlâng chu tawng sawmthum bial vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tlâng hnuaiah chuan kuhmûm lem hian a vêl chhuak a, tawng sâwm a ni a, zêm vêl chuan a awm a. Chûng kuhmûmte chu tlar hnihin a awm a, chhûn tel nghâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chu chu bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih chungah a innghat a, pathumin hmâr lam an hawi a, pathumin thlang lam an hawi a, pathumin chhim lam an hawi a, pathumin chhak lam an hawi a. Tin, tuizêm chu a chungah chuan a inhûng a, an mei lam chuan chhûng lam a hawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kutphah bawka chhah a ni a; a tlâng chu lili pangpâr ang, no tlang anga siam a ni a. Bath sânghnih dawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hûnchhan sâwm dârin a siam bawk a; hûnchhan pakhat sei lam chu tawng li a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng li bawk a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng thum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, hûnchhan siam dân chu hetiang hi a ni: chûng chuan khuar a nei a, a khuarte chu a tlângte inkârah a awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a tlângte inkâr khuarahte chuan sakeibaknei te, sebâwngpa te, cherub-te a chuang a; a tlâng chungahte chuan hûnchhan a awm a. Sakeibakneite leh sebâwngpate hnuai lamah chuan cheimawina tê tête pawh a awm thliah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hûnchhanahte chuan dâr tawlailîr pali leh dâr tlâwn a awm ṭheuh va, a kil liahte chuan innghahna a awm ṭheuh va. Insilna bêl hnuai lamah chuan a innghahna chhûn a awm a, a sîrah chuan cheimawina a awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Belvâlkual chhûng kotlâng chu tawng khat tla a ni a; a rawng kotlâng chu belvâl anga bial a ni a, tawng khat leh a chanve a ni; tin, a rawng tlâng vêl chu ṭial mawi a ni a, a khuarte chu kil li a ni a, a bial lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tawlailîr palite chu a khuar hnuai lamahte chuan a awm a; tin, tawlailîr tlângte chu hûnchhanah chuan a awm a. Tawlailîr sân lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûng tawlailîrte siam dân chu sakawr tawlailîr ke siam dân ang hi a ni a; a tlûng te, a belvâlkual te, a chhunkalhna te, a lai bâwkte chu chhûn vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, hûnchhan kil li ṭheuhvah chuan innghahna pali a awm a; chumi innghahnate chu hûnchhan nên pumkhat vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A hûnchhan chungah chuan belvâlkual, tawng chanvea sâng hi a awm a. Hûnchhan chunga a hûnna kete leh a khuarte chu pumkhat vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A hûnna ke phêkahte leh a khuarahte chuan a zau angzia ziain cherub te, sakeibaknei te, tûm thingte a chuantîr a, a vêl chuan cheimawina hi a awm thliah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutiang vek chuan hûnchhan sâwmte chu a siam a. A vai chuan pumkhata chhûn a ni ṭheuh va, intiat ṭhiau, siam dân inang chiah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, insilna bêl sâwm dârin a siam a; insilna bêl pakhat chuan bath sawmli a dawng a, insilna bêl chu tawng li ṭheuh a ni. Hûnchhan sâwm chungah chuan insilna bêl pakhat a inhûng ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, hûnchhante chu in ding lampangah panga a hûng a, in vei lampangah panga. Tuizêm chu in ding lampangah chhak lamah chhim chhawngin a hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hirama chuan insilna bêl te, vut lawhna te, maihûnte a siam a. Chutichuan, Hirama chuan Lalpa in atâna Solomona a siamsak zawng zawng chu a peih ta vek a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />ban pahnih te, ban chhîpa bêl anga bâwk pahnih tuamna ṭial chik chek pahnih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />chumi tuamna ṭial chik chek pahnih atâna pawmgranet zali te, ban chhîpa bêl anga bâwk pahnih tuamna tûr ṭial chik chek ve ve atâna pawmgranet tlar hnihte kha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />hûnchhan sâwm leh hûnchhan chunga insilna bêl sâwm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />tuizêm leh a hnuaia sebâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />bêlte leh, vut lawhte leh, maihûnte nên. Chûng bungbêl zawng zawng Lalpa in atâna Hiraman Lal Solomona a siamsak chu dâr nawh tlêta siam vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jordan phaizâwlah Sukkoth leh Zarethan inkâr bellei hmunah a ni, lal chuan a chhûn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan chûng bungbêl zawng zawng chu a tam êm êm avângin bûk chhuah lohvin a dah mai a; dâr bûk zât chu hriat chhuah rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Lalpa ina bungbêl awm zawng zawng chu a siam a; rangkachak maichâm leh chhangdah awmna dawhkân chu rangkachakin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />biakna hmun hmazâwn khâwnvâr dahna ding lama panga leh vei lama panga chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin; pangpâr te, khâwnvâr te leh chaichehte chu rangkachakin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />no te, khâwnvâr puan chehna te, maihûn te, fian te, mei lâknate chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin; in chhûngril zâwk, hmun thianghlim ber kawngkhâra mite leh in (biak in chu) kawngkhâr vuahnate chu rangkachakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Solomonan Lalpa in atâna a siam zawng zawng chu a lo peih ta vek a; tichuan, Solomona chuan a pa Davida lo hlan sa tawh - tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungbêl te chu a la lût a, Lalpa ina rote zîngah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan Israel upaho te, an hnam puipa zawng zawng te, Israela thlahho chhûngkaw puipate chu, Jerusalem khuaa Lal Solomona hnênah chuan Davida khawpui Zion ata Lalpa thuthlung bâwm zâwn chho tûrin a khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Israel mi zawng zawng chu Ethanim thla (thla sarihnaah chuan) kûtnaah Lal Solomona hnênah an inkhâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel upaho zawng zawng chu an lo kal a, puithiamte chuan bâwm chu an zâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm leh, inbiakna puan in leh, chuta bungbêl thianghlim zawng zawng chu an zâwn chho va; chûngte chu puithiamte leh Levi chite chuan an zâwn chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona leh Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng, a hnêna rawn inkhâwmte chu bâwm hmaah an awm ho va, berâm leh bâwngpa, a tam avânga chhiar sên rual loh leh a zât hriat sên rual lohvin an inthawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiamte chuan Lalpa thuthlung bâwm chu a awmna tûrah an la lût a, in chhûnga biakna hmun, hmun thianghlim berah, cherub-te thla hnuaiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherub-te chuan bâwm awmna chung zâwnah chuan an thla an zâr reng si a, cherub-te chuan bâwm leh a zâwnfungte chu an huap vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a zâwnfungte chu a sei khawp a, a zâwnfung hmâwrte chu biakna hmunhma, hmun thianghlim aṭang chuan a hmuh theih a; amaherawhchu, pâwn lamah zawng a lang lo. Tûn thleng hian chutah chuan a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata an chhuaha Lalpan Israela thlahte hnêna thu a thlun laia, Mosian Horeb tlânga lungphêk pahnih a dahte chauh lo kha chu, chumi bâwm chhûngah chuan eng mah dang a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, puithiamhote chu hmun thianghlim ata an lo chhuah veleh chuan Lalpa in chu chhûm chuan a khat ta mup mai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tichuan, chhûm avâng chuan puithiamte chu rawngbâwlin an awm thei ta lo hial a; Lalpa ropuinain Lalpa in chu a tikhat ta vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan thu a sawi ta a: “ Lalpan , ‘Thim chhah mupah chuan ka awm ang,’ a ti rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I chênna tûr in, kumkhuaa i awmna tûr chu ka lo saksak ta ngei che a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a lehhawi a, Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng chu mal a sâwm a; tichuan, Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng chu an ding ṭhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, ka pa Davida hnêna ama kâ ngeia, ‘Aigupta ram ata ka mi Israel-te ka hruai chhuah ni aṭangin Israel-ho hnam zînga khawii khua mah hi ka hming awmna tûr in sak nân ka la thlang ngai lo va; amaherawhchu, ka mi Israel-te hotu atân hian Davida hi ka thlang a ni,’ tia lo sawitu, ama kut ngeia rawn puitlintu hi fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka pa Davida khân Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hming atân in sak a rilruin a tum ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan ka pa Davida hnênah, ‘I rilruah chuan ka hming atân in sak i tum ṭhîn a, hetiang rilru i lo pu hi i tiṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang zawngin in chu i sa lo vang; i fapa, i ṭhâlbea la chhuak tûra chuan ka hming atân in chu a la sa zâwk ang,’ a lo ti tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a thusawi chu a rawn tinghet ta a; Lalpa lo tiam tawh ang ngeiin ka pa Davida hmun chu ka lo luah tain, Israel lalṭhutthlêngah chuan ka lo ṭhu ta a; Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hming atân in chu ka lo sa ta ngei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutah chuan bâwm awmna tûr hmun chu ka lo ruat ta a, chumiah chuan Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuah laia kan pute hnêna a lo thlun, Lalpa thuthlung chu a awm a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chu Lalpa maichâm hmaa Israel pung khâwmho zawng zawng hmuhah a ding a, vân lam banin a kut a phar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chhiahhlawh, an thinlung zawng zawnga i mit hmuha awm ṭhate hnêna thuthlung hlena khawngaihna tilang ṭhîn, i chhiahhlawh ka pa Davida hnêna thutiam hlentu, chung lam vânah leh hnuai lam leiah hian nangmah ang hi Pathian dang rêng rêng an awm lo ve; a ni, nangin i kâin thu i sawi a, i kutin i rawn hlawhtlintîr ta a, vawiina a lo awm ta ngei ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chhiahhlawh ka pa Davida hnêna, ‘I thlahte chu ka mit hmuha i awm anga ka mit hmuha awm ve tûra an awm dâna an fîmkhur phawt chuan, ka mit hmuhah Israel-te lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr i hmai lo vang,’ tia i lo tiam tâk kha hlen ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, aw Israel-te Pathian, nangin i chhiahhlawh ka pa Davida hnêna thu i lo sawi tawh kha khawngaih takin thlentîr ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian chu leiah hian a awm tak meuh ang emaw chu? Ngai teh, vân leh vânte vânah pawh i leng lo a ni a; he ka in sakah hian i va leng lo nasa lehzual âwm êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa ka Pathian, vawiina i chhiahhlawhin a auhna che leh ṭawngṭaina a chham hi ngaihthlâksakin, i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna hi rawn ngaihsak ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />hemi hmun lam hawia i chhiahhlawh hian ṭawngṭaina a chham tûr chu ngaithlaa nangin, ‘Chutah chuan ka hming chu a awm ang,’ i tihna hmun ngei in lamah hian chhûn leh zâna i mit i lên reng ṭhin theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, i chhiahhlawh leh i mi Israel-te hian hemi hmun lam hawia an ṭawngṭai hunin an dîlnate lo ngaihthlâksak ṭhîn ang che. A ni, i chênna hmun vânan lo ngaithla langin; tin, lo ngaithlain ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin a vêngte chungah thil tisualin, chhechhamtîr hial lo ṭûl sela, hemi ina i maichâm hmaah hian rawn chham sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />nangin vân aṭangin lo ngaithla langin, che la, mi sual chu ama lû chungah ngei a awm dân nghata thiam loh chantîrin, mi fel chu a felna ang ang hlawhtîra thiam chantîrin i chhiahhlawhte ro rêlsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I mi Israel-te hian i chungah thil an tihsual avânga hmêlmate laka an lo tlâwma i lam an lo hawi leha, i hming an faka, hemi ina ṭawngṭaia thil an rawn dîl chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />nangin vân aṭangin lo ngaihthlâksak la, i mi Israel-te sualna chu ngaidam la, an pute ram i pêkah hruai leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I chunga thil an tihsual avânga vân a pina, ruahte a lo sûr loh hunah chuan, hemi hmun lam hawia an ṭawngṭaia, i hming an faka, anmahni i tihretheih avânga an sualte an sim chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />nangin vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, i chhiahhlawhte leh i mi Israel-te sualna hi ngaidam langin, an kalna tûr kawng ṭha i kawhhmuh dâwn si a; tin, i mite an rochan atâna i pêk i ramah hian ruah han sûrtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kan ramah hian ṭâm te a lo tlâka, hri te a lo lêna, rona emaw, ṭawihna emaw, khaukhuap emaw, pangang emaw a lo awma, an hmêlmaten an kawngka vêlahte an rawn huala, hri eng pawh, natna eng pawh a lo thlen chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />i mi Israel zawng zawng zînga mahni thinlunga hri awma hriaa, hemi in lam hawia kut rawn phar apiangin ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna an rawn hlan rêng rêng chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />i awmna vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, ngaidam la, che la, nang an thinlung hretu, mi tin an awm dân ang zêlin hlawhtîr ang che (nang zawng, nangmah chauh hi mihring fa zawng zawng thinlung hretu i ni si a);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />kan pute i pêk rama an awm chhûng zawng hian an ṭih theihna tûr chein.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />I mi Israel-te ni lo hnam dang mi, i hming avânga ram hla tak ata lo kalte chungchâng thu pawh hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />(i hming ropui tak te, i kut chak tak te, i bân i phar thûte hi an la hre hlawm dâwn si a): chûngte chuan hemi in lam hawia an rawn ṭawngṭai hunin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />nangin i awmna vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, hnam dang mi chuan a dîl ang ang che chu lo tihsak ang che; i mi Israel-te ang bawka khawvêla hnam tinin i hming an hriata, an ṭih chia, hemi ka in sak hian i hming a pu a ni tih an lo hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />I miten an hmêlmate chu i tirhna lam apiangah lo bei sela, i khawpui thlan lam hawi leh, i hming atân in ka lo sak lam hawia Lalpa hnêna an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />an ṭawngṭaina leh an dîlna chu nangin vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, an thûah che ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />I chunga thil an tihsuala (tu mah thil tisual lo an awm âwm si lo va), an chunga i thinura, hmêlma kuta i pêka, hmêlma ram hla takah emaw, hnai teah emaw pawh sala an hruaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />sala an hruaina rama an inngaihtuah chhuaha, an inchhîra, ‘Thil kan lo tisual a, dik lo tak leh sual takin kan ti ta,’ tia sala hruaitute rama an rawn ngen chea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />an hmêlma sala hruaitute rama an thinlung tak leh an rilru taka i lam an lo hawia, an pute i pêk ram lam leh, i khawpui thlan lam leh i hming tâna ka in sak lam hawia i hnêna an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />an ṭawngṭaina leh an dîlna chu nangin i awmna vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, an thûah che ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />tin, i mi i chunga thil tisualtute leh i laka an lo bawhchhiat kawnga an bawhchhiatna zawng zawng chu ngaidam la; sala hruaitute chuan anmahni an khawngaih theih nân khawngaihna neihtîr ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />i mi, i rochan, Aigupta ram ata, thîr rawh tuina chhûng ata i hruai chhuahte an ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />an auh apiang chea i lo ngaihthlâk tûra i chhiahhlawh dîlna leh, i mi Israel dîlna lama i mit i len theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, kan pute Aigupta ram ata i hruai chhuah laia i chhiahhlawh Mosia hmanga i sawi angin, i rochan atân khawvêl hnam tin zîng ata i tihrang a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Solomonan Lalpa hnêna a ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna zawng zawng a chham zawh chuan, Lalpa maichâm lama ṭhingṭhia, vân lam bana kut phara a awm chu a tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, a ding a, aw ring takin, “A thutiam zawng zawng ang zêla a mi Israel-te chawlhna petu Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se. A chhiahhlawh Mosia hmanga a thutiam ṭha zawng zawng kha thu pakhat mah a thlâwn lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian chu kan pute hnêna a awm ang khân kan hnênah awm sela; min kalsanin, min thlahthlam suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />tichuan, a kawng zawng zawng zawh tûr leh, kan pute thu a pêk tawh anga a thupêkte, a thuruatte, a rorêlte pawm tûra kan thinlungte a lama a hawitîr theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa hi Pathian a ni a, tu mah dang an awm lo tih khawvêla hnam tinin an lo hriat theihna tûra a chhiahhlawh thûah leh, a mi Israel-te thûah hian a ni zir ang zêla a chêt theihna tûrin hêng ka thusawi, Lalpa hmaa dîlna ka thlente hi chhûn leh zân Lalpa kan Pathian hmaah chuan châm reng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Chutichuan, a thuruat anga awm tûr leh a thupêkte zâwm tûrin Lalpa kan Pathian lamah chuan in thinlungte ṭha famkim rawh se, vawiin ang hian,” tiin Israel pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, lal leh Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan Lalpa hmaah inthawina an hlân za a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin, Solomonan Lalpa tâna a hlan remna thilhlan inthawi nân sebâwngpa sînghnih leh sânghnih leh, berâm nuai khat leh sînghnih a hlân a. Chutiang chuan lal leh Israela thlahte zawng zawng chuan Lalpa in chu an hlân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Chumi ni vêkah chuan lalin Lalpa in hma zâwna hung chhûng kawtlai tak chu a tithianghlim a, chutah chuan hâlral thilhlan te, chhangphut thilhlan te, remna thilhlan sa thau te chu a hlân a, Lalpa hmaa dâr maichâm chu chûng thilhlante dawng tûra a têt luattuk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi ṭum chuan Solomona leh Israel-ho zawng zawng, mipui pung khâwmho tam tak, Hamath khaw luhna achin Aigupta ram lui thlenga mite chu, Lalpa kan Pathian hmaah chuan ni sarih leh ni sarih - ni sâwm leh ni li chhûng zet an kût za a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ni riat ni chuan mipuihote chu a ṭîntîr a; tin, lal chu mal an sâwm a, Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Davida leh a mi Israel-te chunga a ṭhatna chuti zozaia a lantîr avâng chuan rilru hlim leh lâwm takin an in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Solomonan Lalpa in leh lal in a saka, Solomonan châk taka a tum zawng zawng a tih zawh vek hnuah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon khuaa a hnêna a inlâr ang khân Lalpa chu Solomona hnênah a rawn inlâr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I ṭawngṭaina leh i dîlna ka hmaa i rawn thlente kha ka lo ngaithla a; hemi in i sak hi kumkhuaa ka hming awmtîr nân ka tithianghlim tawh e, ka mit leh ka thinlung chu chutah chuan a awm kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, nang pawh hi thu ka pêk apiang che anga ti tûra i pa Davida awm anga thinlung ṭha tak pu leh rilru dik tak pua ka mit hmuha i awma, ka thuruatte leh ka rorêlte i pawm reng zawngin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel-te chungah hian i ram lalṭhutthlêng chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang, i pa Davida hnêna, ‘Israel-te lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr i hmai lo vang,’ tia ka lo tiam tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nangin emaw, in thlahten emaw min zui chu min kîrsana, ka thupêkte leh ka thuruatte ka hriattîr che u hi in pawm lohva, pathian dangte rawng in va bâwla, in va biak chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-hote hi ram ka pêk ata ka tiboral ang a; tin, hemi in, ka hming atâna ka tihthianghlim tawh sa hi ka mit hmuh phâk lohvah ka sawn bo daih ang. Tichuan, Israel-te hi hnam tinrêngte zîngah tihelna leh a chhe lam tehkhinnaah hman an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, he in hi sâng teh mah sela, a kal pêl apiangte chu mak tiin an la faifûk ang a, ‘Engati nge Lalpan he ram leh he in hi heti taka a tih le?’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, miten, ‘ Lalpa an Pathian, an pute Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu kha an kalsana, pathian dangte an vawna, an biaka, an rawng te an bâwl tâk vâng a ni; chuvângin, Lalpan hêng chhiatna zawng zawng hi an chungah a rawn thlentîr ta a nih hi,’ tiin an la chhâng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Solomonan in pahnih, Lalpa in leh lal in a sak chhûng, kum sawmhnih a vei hnuin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Tura lal Hiraman Solomona chu sidar thing te, fâr thing te, rangkachak te a mamawh apiang a tum vek a ni a), Lal Solomona chuan Hirama chu Galili rama khaw sawmhnih a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Hirama chu Tura khua aṭangin Solomonan khua a pêkte chu en tûrin a chhuak a; a duh zâwng a ni lo hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka unaupa, hêng i khaw mi pêkte hi khaw eng nge maw ni ngai le?” a ti a. Tichuan, tûn thleng hian Kabul ram an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Hirama chuan lal chu rangkachak talent 120 a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Solomonan hnathawka rawih luih pâwl a siam chhan chu hei vâng hi a ni: Lalpa in leh ama in satu atân leh, Milo te, Jerusalem kulh te, Hazor khua te, Megido khua te, Gezer khua te siamtu atân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta lal Pharaoa chu a han chho va, Gezer khua a han la a, a hâl a, chu khuaa awm Kanaan-hote chu a that a, a fanu Solomona nupui hnênah inthlahna thilpêk atân a lo pe tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Solomonan Gezer khua te, Beth-horon thlangta zâwk khua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baalath khua te, Israel rama thlalêra Tamar khua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomonan thil dah khâwmna khua a neih zawng zawng te, a tawlailîr dahna khua te leh, a sakawr chung chuang mi dahna khua te, Jerusalem khua te, Lebanon-ah te leh a rorêlna ram chhûng zawng zawnga Solomonan châk taka siam a tum zawng zawngte chu a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte ni ve lo, Amor-hote, Hit-hote, Periz-hote, Hiv-hote, Jebus-ho la awm zawng zawngte kha chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an thlah, chûng rama la awm Israela thlahten an tihboral zawh vek theih lohvate zîngah chuan Solomonan chhiahhlawh, hnathawka rawih luih pâwl a siam a, tûn thleng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israela thlahte erawh chu Solomonan chhiahhlawhah a siam ve lo va; indo mi te, a puipa te, a mi lian te, a sipai hotu te, a tawlailîr leh a sakawr chung chuang mi hotute an ni zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûngte chu Solomona hna chunga hotu bîk zanga leh sawmnga, hnathawk vêngtute chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pharaoa fanu erawh chu Davida khawpui ata chu ama in, Solomonan a saksakah chuan a chho ta a; tichuan, Milo chu a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Lalpa tâna maichâm a siamah chuan kum tin vawi thum hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan a hlân ṭhîn a, Lalpa hmaa maichâmah chuan rimtuite a hâl tel bawk ṭhîn a. Chutichuan, in chu a peih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chuan Edom rama Tuifinriat Sen kam Eloth bula awm Ezion-geber hmunah lawng rual a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Hiraman a chhiahhlawh lawng mite tuifinriata che ṭhang, lawnga Solomona chhiahhlawhte kalpuiah a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chung mite chu Ophir-ah an va kal a, chuta mi chu rangkachak talent zali leh sawmhnih an rawn hâwn a, Lal Solomona hnênah an rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa hming tâna a thiltih chungchâng thûa Solomona hmingthanzia Seba lalnuin a lo hriat chuan, thu khirh tak taka fiah tumin a hnênah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaah hnungzuitu tam tak hruaiin, englo rimtuite leh rangkachak tam tak leh lunghlute phur sanghâwngseite kengin a kal a; tin, Solomona hnên a thlen chuan a thinlunga a thu pai zawng zawng chu phawrh fai vekin a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan a thu zawh zawng zawng chu a chhâng vek a; lal hriat loh, a hrilhfiah theih loh rêng rêng a awm hauh lo mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Seba lalnuin Solomona finzia zawng zawng te, a in sak te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a dawhkâna ei tûr te, a puipateho ṭhut dân te, a rawngbâwltuho bâwl dân te, an inchei dân te, a no hlântu te, Lalpa ina a hlan hâlral thilhlante a han hmuh chuan rilru ahleih a nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, lal hnênah, “I thiltihte leh i finziate keima rama ka lo hriat kha thuthang dik tak a lo nih ngei hi le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, keimahin ka mit ngeia ka rawn hmuh hma loh chuan an sawi chu ka lo âwih lo va; tichuan, ngai teh, a zâtve pawh mi lo hrilh hlei nêm, an sawi ka lo hriat aiin i finzia leh i ṭhatzia a lo nasat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I mite, hêng i chhiahhlawh, i bula awm fova, i finna thu ngaithla fovate hi an nihlawh e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian, i chunga lâwm êm êm, Israel-te lalṭhutthlênga ṭhuttîrtu che hi fakin awm rawh se! Lalpan Israel-te hi kumkhuain a hmangaih a; chuvângin, fel taka rorêl tûrin lalah a siam che a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lal chu rangkachak talent za leh sawmhnih leh englo rimtui tam zet mai leh lunghlute a pe a. Seba lalnuin Lal Solomona englo rimtui a pêk ang zozaia tam hi a lût ngai ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Hirama lawng rual, Ophir aṭanga rangkachak va phurte pawh chuan Ophir aṭangin almug thing tam tak leh lunghlute an rawn phur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lalin almug thingte chu Lalpa in leh lal in hung nân leh, hla satute tân ṭingṭang leh perhkhuangte siam nân lam pawh a hmang a. Tûn thlengin chutiang almug thing rêng rêng chu a lûtin, hmuh pawh hmuh a ni ngai ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomonan a duhsak vânga a pêkte bâkah pawh Lal Solomona chuan Seba lalnu chu a duh zawng zawng, a dîl apiang chu a pe a. Chutichuan, a awmna ram lamah a hâwng leh ta a, a hote nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomona hnêna kum khat chhûnga rangkachak lût rih lam chu, sumdâwngtute laka lût leh thil zuartute, mi inawmpawlhho lal zawng zawngte leh ram awptute laka lûtte chhiar lovin, rangkachak talent zaruk leh sawmruk leh paruk bûk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lal Solomona chuan rangkachak den phêkin phaw lian zahnih a siam a; phaw pakhatah rangkachak sekel zaruk a duh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak den phêkin phaw zathum a siam a; phaw pakhatah rangkachak maneh thum a duh a. Chûng chu lal chuan Lebanon ngawpui inah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan saingho lalṭhutthlêng ropui tak a siam bawk a, chu chu rangkachak ṭha ber tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng kai chhohnaah chuan rahka paruk a awm a, chumi lalṭhutthlêng hnung lam chu a rawn kum phei kulh a; a ṭhutna sîr tuakah chuan dona a awm ve ve a, dona bulahte chuan sakeibaknei pahnih hi a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, rahka parukah chuan a sîr tuakah sakeibaknei sâwm leh pahnih a ding a; chutiang chu khawii ramah mah an siam ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal Solomona no zawng zawng chu rangkachak vek a ni a; tin, Lebanon ngawpui ina bungbêl zawng zawngte pawh chu rangkachak hlîr hlak vek a ni a. Tangkarua rêng rêng a awm lo; Solomona dam lai chuan chu chu eng hûah mah an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal chuan tuifinriatah chuan Hirama lawng rual kawppuitu Tarsis lawng rual a nei a. Tarsis lawng rual chuan kum thum dan zêlah rangkachak te, tangkarua te, saingho te, zâwng te, ârâwnte a rawn phur si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Solomona chuan khawvêla lal zawng zawng chu hausakah leh finah a khûm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathianin a thinlunga finna thu a dahsak chu ngaithla tûrin khawvêla mi zawng zawng chuan Solomona chu an pan huai huai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mi tinin lâwmman kum tin pêk bi neiin tangkaraw bungbêl te, rangkachak bungbêl te, puan te, râlthuam te, englo rimtui te, sakawr te, sabengtungte an rawn pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite a khâwm chiam a; tawlailîr sângkhat leh zali leh sakawr chung chuang mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a, chûng chu tawlailîr dahna khuaah te, Jerusalem khuaa lal awmnaahte chuan a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan, Jerusalem khuaah chuan, a tam êm avângin tangkaruate chu lung ang maia ngaih khawpin a awmtîr a, sidar thingte chu phaia theipui thing ang leka ngaih khawpin a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Solomona neih sakawrte chu Aigupta ram ata rawn tawlh chhuah a ni a; tin, lal sumdâwngtute chuan chûng chu a rual rualin an lo khâr ṭhîn a, a ruala lei zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aigupta rama mi tawlailîr chu tangkarua sekel zaruk zêlin an tithleng ṭhîn a, sakawr chu tangkarua sekel za leh sawmnga zêlin; chutiang bawk chuan Hit-ho lal zawng zawng leh Suria lalte pawh an tihthlensak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona chuan Pharaoa fanu chang lo pawh hnam dang hmeichhe tam tak - Moab te, Amon te, Edom te, Sidon te, Hit-ho hmeichhiate a hmangaih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chûng hnamho chungchâng thu chu Lalpan Israela thlahte hnênah, “Anmahni pâwl suh ula, anni pawhin pâwl che u suh se, an pathiante lamah in thinlung an hruai kawi ngei dâwn si a,” tiin a lo sawi tawh rêng a. Chûngho chu Solomona chuan hmangaihnain a vuan tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, nupui zasarih, lal fanu a nei a, hmei zathum nên; tin, a nupuite chuan a thinlung an hruai kawisak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni ta a, Solomona chu a lo upat hnu chuan, a nupuite chuan pathian dangte lamah a thinlung an hruai kawisak a; tichuan, a pa Davida thinlung angin Lalpa a Pathian lamah chuan a thinlung chu a lo ṭha famkim ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomona chuan Zidon-ho pathiannu Astarothi leh Amon-ho pathian tenawm tak Milkoma chu a lo zui ve ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Solomona chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual a lo ti ta a, a pa Davida angin Lalpa chu a zui tlat ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan Jerusalem bula tlângah Moab-ho pathian tenawm tak Kemosa tân leh, Amona thlahte pathian tenawm tak Moleka tân hmun sâng a lo siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin hnam dang a nupui zawng zawng, an pathiante hnêna inthawia rimtui hâl ṭhînte tân pawh a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, a hnêna vawi hnih lai inlâra, he thu, pathian dangte a zui tûr a ni lo tih thu lo petu chu, a thinlungin a hawisan tâk avângin Solomona chungah chuan Lalpa thin a lo ur ta a; Lalpan thu a pêk chu pawm si hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpan Solomona hnênah chuan, “Hetiang hian i lo awm ta a, ka thuthlungte leh ka thuruatte pawm tûra thu ka pêk che hi i lo pawm ta si lo va, ram hi ka chhuhsak ngei ang chia, i chhiahhlawh ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, i pa Davida avângin i dam chhûng êm chuan ka ti rih lo vang a; nimahsela, i fapa zawng ka chhuhsak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram zawng zawng erawh chu ka chhuhsak vek lo vang a; nimahsela, ka chhiahhlawh Davida avâng leh ka thlan Jerusalem avâng hian hnam khat chu i fapa ka pe ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Edom mi, Hadada chu Solomona hmêlmaah a rawn din chhuak ta a; amah chu Edom rama lal thlah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Davida chu Edom rama a awm laia, an mi thahte phûm tûra sipai hotu Joaba a han kala, Edom mi mipa fa tawh phawt chu a han thah vek hnu khân
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Joaba leh Israel mi zawng zawng chu thla ruk zet, Edom rama mipa zawng zawng a tihhlum vek hma loh chuan an awm a ni a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hadada chu a pa chhiahhlawhte zînga Edom mi ṭhenkhat nên Aigupta rama kal tûrin an tlân a. Hadada chu naupang tê a la ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midian ram ata an chhuak a, Paran-ah an kal a; tin, Paran aṭangin mite an hruai a, Aigupta ram, Aigupta ram lal Pharaoa hnên an zuk thleng a; ani chuan in te a lo pe a, ei tûr te a lo ngaihtuahsak a, ram te a lo pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadada chuan Pharaoa mit a tlung hle mai a; tichuan, a nupui ngei laizâwn, Lalnu Tahpenesi laizâwn chu nupuiah a neihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Tahpenesi laizâwn chuan fapa Genubatha a hrinsak a, Tahpenesi chuan Pharaoa inah a hnute hnêk bânna a siamsak a. Tin, Genubatha chu Pharaoa inah Pharaoa fate zîngah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Hadadan Aigupta ram aṭanga Davida chu a puteho hnênah a muhîl ta tih leh, sipai hotu Joaba pawh a thi tawh tih a lo hriatin, Hadada chuan Pharaoa hnênah, “Kan rama ka haw theih nân mi chhuahtîr ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharaoan a hnênah, “Ka hnêna i awm hian tlâkchham eng nge i neih ni le, ngai teh, chutia in ram lama haw leh i tum tâk mai?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Eng mah phei chu nei lo ve; nimahsela, mi kaltîr rêng rêng rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin a hmêlmaah Eliada fapa Rezona, a pu Hadadezera, Zoba lal hnên ata tlân bo tawh kha a rawn din chhuak leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Davidan Zoba khuaa mite a thah khân ani chuan a hnênah mite a kai khâwm a, sipai hotuah a ṭang ta a. Tin, Damaska khuaah an kal a, chutah chuan an awm a, Damaska khuaah chuan lalah a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hadada tihhrehawmna belhchhahin Solomona dam chhûng zawng, Israel-te hmêlma a ni ṭhîn rêng a; Israel-te a haw hle mai a, Suria ram chungah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Nebata fapa Jeroboama, Zereda khuaa Ephraim mi, Solomona chhiahhlawh pawh chuan (a nu hming chu Zeru-i a ni a, hmeithai a ni a), chu mi pawh chuan lal chungah a kut a lek ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chunga a kut a lek chhan chu hetiang hi a ni: Solomonan Milo a siam a, a pa Davida khua chu a chhe laite a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu Jeroboama chu mi chak huaisen a ni a; tichuan, Solomonan chu tlangvâl chu mi taima tak nia a hriat avângin, Josefa chhûngte hnathawh zawng zawng chunga hotuah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan heti hi a ni a, Jerusalem khua ata Jeroboama a kal chhuak chu Silo mi zâwlnei Ahijan kawng lakah a lo hmu a; Ahija chuan puan thar a sin a, an pahnih chauh chuan phûlah an awm dûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Ahija chuan a puan thar sin chu a la a, phel sâwm leh phel hnihah a pawt thlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeroboama hnênah chuan, “Phel sâwm hi la rawh khai, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ngai teh, ram hi Solomona ka chhuhsak ang a, hnam sâwm chu ka pe dâwn che a ni
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />(amaherawhchu, ka chhiahhlawh Davida avâng leh Israel hnam zawng zawng zînga ka thlan khawpui, Jerusalem avâng hian hnam khat zawng a nei ang chu);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />anni chuan mi kalsan a, Zidon-ho pathiannu Astarothi te, Moab-ho pathian Kemosa te, Amon-ho thlahte pathian Milkoma-te an biak avâng leh, ka mit hmuha thil ṭha ti tûr leh, ka thuruatte leh ka rorêlte hi pawm tûra a pa Davida anga ka kawngte an zawh loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ram pum pui zawng ka chhuhsak lo vang; amaherawhchu, ka thupêkte leh ka thuruatte pawmtu, ka thlan, ka chhiahhlawh Davida avângin a dam chhûng chuan lalah ka la awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nimahsela, ram hi a fapa ka chhuhsak ang a, nangmah hi ka pe dâwn che a ni, hnam sâwmte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ka chhiahhlawh Davidan ka hming awmtîr nâna ka thlan khawpui Jerusalem-ah hian, ka hmaa khâwnvâr a neih reng theihna tûrin hnam khat chu a fapa ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nang hi ka ruat ang chia, i duh ang angin ro i rêl ang a, Israel-te lalah i awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, thu ka pêk apiang che i pawma, ka kawngte i zawha, ka chhiahhlawh Davida anga ka thuruatte leh ka thupêkte zâwm tûra ka mit hmuha thil ṭha i tih chuan i hnênah ka awm zêl ang a, Davida ka din nghehsak ang khân chhûngkaw nghet ka dinsak ang chia, Israel-te hi ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Davida thlah chu ka tihrehawm dâwn a ni; amaherawhchu, kumkhua zawngin a ni lo vang,’ a ti e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chuan Jeroboama chu thah a tum ta a. Nimahsela, Jeroboama chu a tho va, Aigupta ram lal Sisaka hnênah a tlân a, Solomona thih hma loh chuan Aigupta ramah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solomona chanchin dangte leh, a thiltih zawng zawng leh a finnate chu Solomona thiltih ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Solomonan Israel-ho zawng zawng chunga Jerusalem khuaa ro a rêl chhûng chu kum sawmli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomona chu a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, a pa Davida khawpuiah chuan an phûm ta a. Tin, a fapa Rehoboama chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chu Sekem khuaah a kal a; Israel-ho zawng zawng chu Sekem khuaah chuan lala siam tûrin an kal tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Nebata fapa Jeroboaman chumi thu chu a lo hriat chuan (Lal Solomona hnên aṭanga a tlân bona Aigupta rama la awm a ni a; tichuan, Aigupta rama Jeroboama a la awm reng chu an zuk kohtîr a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeroboama leh Israel pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu an lo kal a, Rehoboama hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I pa khân kan nghâwngkawl a tirit êm êm ṭhîn a; chuvângin, i pa min chhawr rimna leh, a nghâwngkawl rit tak kan chunga a nghah hi min tihzânsak la; tichuan, i rawng kan bâwl ang e,” tiin an rawn sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ni thum chhûng chu lo va kal kiang ta rih ula; tin, ka hnênah lo kal leh ang che u,” a ti a. Tin, mipuite chu an kal kiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lal Rehoboama chuan a pa Solomona dam laia a bula awm ṭhîn upahote chu, “Hêng mipuihote hi ka chhân dân tûr rem eng nge mi ruatpui le?” tiin a râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Tûnah hian hêngho chhiahhlawha i awma, an rawng i bâwla, anmahni chu i chhâna, an hnêna thu ṭha tak sawi i tum chuan, kumkhuain i chhiahhlawhah an awm ang,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, upaho remruatpui chu a pawm lo va, ama rualpui tlangvâlho, a bula awm ṭhînte chu a râwn ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Hêng mipuiho, ka hnêna, ‘I pan kan chunga nghâwngkawl a nghah hi min tihzânsak rawh,’ tia sawitute hi ka chhân dân tûr rem eng nge mi ruatpui le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a rualpui tlangvâlhote chuan a hnênah, “Hêng mipuiho, ‘I pa khân kan nghâwngkawl a tirit êm ṭhîn a, nang chuan min tihzânsak rawh khai,’ i hnêna titute hnênah chuan hetiang hian ti la, hetiang hian an hnênah sawi ang che: ‘Ka pa kâwng ai chuan ka zungtê hi a lian zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa khân nghâwngkawl rit tak a lo bahtîr che u a, kei chuan in nghâwngkawl chu ka belhchhah dâwn asin; ka pan vuaknain a lo hrîng ṭhîn che u a, kei erawh chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrîng dâwn che u a ni!’ tiin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jeroboama leh mipuiho zawng zawng chu lalin, “Ni thum chinah ka hnênah lo kal leh ang che u,” tia a hrilh ang khân, a ni thum ni chuan Rehoboama hnênah an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan mipuite chu chang takin a lo chhâng a, upahote remruatpui kha a pawm lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tlangvâlhote remruatpui ang khân, “Ka pan in nghâwngkawl a lo tirit a, kei chuan in nghâwngkawl chu ka belhchhah dâwn asin; ka pan vuaknain a lo hrîng ṭhîn che u a, kei erawh chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrîng dâwn che u a ni!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan mipuite thusawi kha a pawm ta lo va; chu chu Lalpa vâng a ni, Lalpan Silo mi Ahija hmanga, Nebata fapa Jeroboama hnêna a thu lo sawi tawh kha a tihngheh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan lalin an thusawi a pawm lo tih an hriatin, mipuite chuan, “Davidaah hian chanvo eng nge kan neih le? Jesaia fapaah chuan roluah tûr kan nei hek lo. Aw Israel-te u, in puan in lamah haw rawh u. Aw David, i chhûngkua ngaihtuah mai tawh,” tiin lal chu an chhâng a. Chutichuan, Israel-ho chu an puan in lamah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israela thlah, Judai ram khuaa awmte erawh chu, an chungah Rehoboaman ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Rehoboama chuan hnathawka rawih luihte hotu Adorama a tîr a; ani chu Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan lungin an dêng a, a thi ta a. Tin, Lal Rehoboama chu Jerusalem khuaa tlân tumin a tawlailîrah a chuang ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-hote chu Davida chhûngte chungah an lo hel ta a ni, tûn thleng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Israel-ho zawng zawngin Jeroboama chu a lo kîr leh tih an hriatin punkhâwmnaa lo kal tûrin an kohtîr a, Israel-ho zawng zawng chunga lalah an siam ta a. Juda hnam chauh lo chuan tu mahin Davida chhûngte an zui lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chuan Jerusalem khua a han thlen chuan, Israela chhûngte chu dova, Solomona fapa Rehoboama rama la leh tûrin Juda chhûngte zawng zawng leh, Benjamin hnam, mi huaisen ṭhiau thlan chhuah nuai khat leh sîngriat zet a khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian mi Semaia hnênah Pathian thu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judai ram lal Solomona fapa Rehoboama hnênah leh Juda leh Benjamina chhûngte zawng zawng hnênah leh mipui dangte hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘Han kal suh u, Israela thlah, in unauteho chu han do hek suh u. Mahni in lamah haw leh vek tawh u; hei hi keima tih a ni e, tiin,’ sawi rawh,” tiin. Chutichuan, Lalpa thu chu an âwih a, Lalpa thu ang chuan an kîr a, an haw leh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jeroboama chuan Ephraim tlâng ramah Sekem khua a siam a, chutah chuan a awm a; tin, chuta ṭang chuan a chhuak a, Penuel khua a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Jeroboama chuan a rilruin, “Ram hi Davida chhûngte ta a lo ni leh nghe nghe ang â:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />he miteho hi Jerusalem khuaa Lalpa ina inthawinate hlân tûra an kal chuan, he miteho thinlung hi an lalpa Rehoboama, Judai ram lal lamah hian a thle leh mai ang a; tichuan, kei hi min that ang a, Judai ram lal Rehoboama lamah an pakai leh mai ang â,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan mi a râwn a, rangkachak bâwngno lem pahnih a siam a, an hnênah chuan, “In tân Jerusalem khuaa han kal chu a harsa lutuk êm a, aw Israel-te u, en teh u, Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu che u in pathiante hi!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, pakhat chu Bethel-ah a dah a, pakhat chu Dan-ah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chu thil chu sual a lo ni ta a ni; mipuite chu a pahniha be tûrin Dan thleng thlengin an kal si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, hmun sâng inte a sa a, Levia fate ni lo, vântlang zînga mi puithiamahte a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeroboama chuan Judai rama kût an neih ang bawkin thla riatna, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni nga ni chu kût nîah a ruat ve a, maichâmah chuan a han kal a. Bethel-ah chuan a bâwngno lem siam hnêna inthawiin chutiang chuan a ti a ni. Tin, a siam hmun sâng puithiamte chu Bethel-ah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, amahin a duh anga a ruat thla ngei, thla riatna, ni sâwm leh ni nga nîah chuan Bethel-a a maichâm siamah a han kal a. Tin, Israela thlahte tân kût a ruat a, maichâma rimtui hâl tûrin a han kal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Judai ram aṭangin Pathian mi, Lalpa thuin Bethel-ah a lo kal a; tin, Jeroboama chu maichâm bulah rimtui hâl tûrin a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thuin maichâm chu a au khum a, “Aw maichâm, maichâm, Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘Ngai teh, Davida chhûngte zîngah fapa a hming Josia a lo piang ang a, i chunga rimtui hâl ṭhîntu, hmun sâng puithiamte hi i chungah hian inthawi nân a la rawn hlân ang a, i chungah hian mihring ruhte an la rawn hâl ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni vêk chuan chhinchhiahna a pe a, “Hei hi Lalpan chhinchhiahna tûr a tih chu a ni: ‘Ngai teh u, maichâm hi a la khi phawk ang a, a chunga meivâpte hi a la baw vek ang,’ tih hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Pathian miin Bethel-a maichâm a han au khum thu lalin a hriat chuan, Jeroboama chuan, “Man rawh u,” tiin maichâm aṭang chuan a kutin a han ban a. Tin, man tuma a banna kut chu a lo zeng ta a; tichuan, a kut chu a la leh thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian miin Lalpa thûa chhinchhiahna tûra a sawi ang khân maichâm pawh chu a khi bawk a, maichâma meivâpte chu a baw ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a chhâng a, Pathian mi hnênah chuan, “Ka kut hi a lo dam leh theihna tûrin Lalpa i Pathian khawngaihna ngên la, mi ṭawngṭaisak teh khai,” a ti a. Tin, Pathian mi chuan Lalpa hnênah a ngên a; tin, lal kut chu a lo dam leh a, a hma ang bawkin a lo awm leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan Pathian mi hnênah, “Ka in lamah ka hnênah lo kal la, va châwl hahdam rih rawh khai; tin, lâwmman ka pe dâwn che nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi chuan lal hnênah, “I in lo zâtve pawh mi pe dâwn mah la, i hnênah zawng ka lo kal chuang lo vang; hemi hmunah hian chhang ka eiin tui rêng rêng pawh ka in hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Chhang va eiin tui rêng rêng pawh va in suh la, i va kalna kawngah pawh haw leh tawh suh,’ tia Lalpa thûa tirh ka ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, kawng dangah a kal a, Bethel-a a lo kalna kawngah chuan a haw leh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bethel khuaah chuan zâwlnei putar pakhat hi a awm a, a fapate chuan chumi nia Bethel-a Pathian mi thiltih zawng zawng chu an hrilh vek a; lal hnêna a thusawite pawh chu an pa an hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an pa chuan an hnênah “Khawii lam kawngah nge a kal tâk?” a ti a. A fapate chuan Judai ram aṭanga lo kal Pathian mi haw lehna kawng chu an kawhhmuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, a fapate hnênah, “Sabengtung mi han siam teh u,” a ti a. Chutichuan, sabengtung chu an siamsak a; tichuan, a chuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi chu a ûm ta a, sasaw thing hnuaia a ṭhu hi a va hmu a; a hnênah, “Nangmah hi em ni Judai ram aṭanga lo kal Pathian mi chu?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka in lamah ka hnênah lo kal la, chhang va ei rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “I ruala kîr leh thei ka ni lo va, i hnêna lo kal thei pawh ka ni hek lo; hemi hmunah hian i hnênah chhang ka eiin tui rêng rêng pawh ka in hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Chhang va eiin, tui rêng rêng pawh va in suh la, i va kalna kawngah pawh kîr leh tawh suh,’ tia Lalpa thûa hrilh ka ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Kei pawh nangmah ang bawka zâwlnei ka ni alâwm; vântirhkohvin Lalpa thuin, ‘Chhang te eia tui te in tûrin i in lamah hruai kîr leh rawh khai,’ tiin mi bia sin,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a hnênah dâwt a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hnênah chuan a kîr leh ve a, a inah chuan chhang te a eiin tui te a in ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, dawhkân an kîl lai chuan a hruai kîrtu zâwlnei hnênah chuan Lalpa thu chu a lo thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judai ram aṭanga lo kal Pathian mi hnênah chuan, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti, Lalpa thusawi i âwih lohva, Lalpa i Pathianin thu a pêk che i pawm loh avâng leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />i lo kîr leha, ‘Chhang va eiin tui rêng rêng pawh va in suh ang che,’ a tihna hmun ngeiah chhang i eia, tui te i in avângin i ruang hi i pute thlâna dah a ni ve lo vang,” tiin a sawi chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chhang te a eia, tui te a in zawh chuan, zâwlnei a hruai kîr leha chu sabengtung a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a kal ta chu kawng lakah sakeibaknei nên an intâwk a, a lo seh ta a. Tin, a ruang chu kawngah chuan theh thal dêrin a awm a, sabengtung chu a bulah chuan a ding a. Sakeibaknei pawh chu ruang bulah chuan a ding ve reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi an va kal a, kawnga ruang theh thal dêra awm leh ruang bula sakeibaknei ding reng chu an va hmu a. Zâwlnei putar pui awmna khuaah chuan an va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, kawnglak ata va hruai kîr lehtu zâwlnei chuan chumi thu a lo hriat veleh chuan, “Pathian mi, Lalpa thusawi âwih duh lo pa kha a nih chu. Chutichuan, Lalpan a hnêna a sawi, a thu ang ngeiin Lalpan sakeibaknei hnênah a pe a, a lo ham a, a seh hlum ta a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a fapate hnênah chuan, “Sabengtung mi siamsak teh u,” tiin a sawi a. Tichuan, an siamsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, a kal ta a, a ruang kawnga theh thal dêra lo awm leh sabengtung leh sakeibaknei, ruang bula lo ding reng chu a va hmu a. Sakeibaknei chuan ruang chu a lo la ei lo va, sabengtung pawh chu a lo la tipem lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei chuan chu Pathian mi ruang chu a hlâwm a, sabengtung chungah chuan a hlâng a, a kîrpui ta a. Tichuan, zâwlnei putar awmna khuaah chuan sûn tûr leh vui tûrin a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a ruang chu ama thlânah a zalh a; tichuan, “A va pawi tehlul êm, ka unaupa!” tiin an ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a vui hnu chuan a fapate hnênah, “Ka thih hunah Pathian mi phûmna thlânah hian mi rawn phûm ve ang che u; a ruh bulah ka ruhte hi rawn dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian thûa Bethel-a maichâm leh, Samari ram khawpuitea hmun sâng in zawng zawng a au khumna thu kha lo thleng ngei ngei tûr a ni si a,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah pawh Jeroboama chuan a awm dân dik lo chu a la bân chuang lo va, vântlang zînga mi hmun sâng puithiam atân a la siam ta cheu va; hmun sâng puithiamte an awm theihna tûrin a duh apiang a tihrang ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chu thil chu Jeroboama chhûngkaw sualna, anmahni tichimittu leh khawvêl ata tiboral hlauhtu a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Jeroboama fapa Abija a damlo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Jeroboama chuan a nupui hnênah, “Tho la, Jeroboama nupui i ni tih an hriat loh nân che intidanglam la, Silo-ah va kal teh khai; ngai teh, chutah chuan zâwlnei Ahija, he miteho chunga lala ka la awm tûr ka chungchâng thu sawitu kha a awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chhangpêr sâwm leh chhang hlâwm tê tê leh khawizu ûm khat keng langin, a hnênah va kal teh; naupang awm dân tûr chu a lo hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jeroboama nupui chuan chutiang chuan a ti a, a tho va, Silo-ah chuan a kal a, Ahija inah chuan a va kal ta a. Ahija chuan khua a hmu thei tawh lo va, a upat avângin a mit a thim tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Ahija hnênah, “Ngai teh, Jeroboama nupui, a fapa chungchânga râwn tûr chein a lo kal e, a damlo a ni a. Hetiang hian lo hrilh ang che; heti hi a ni ang a, a lo luh hunah chuan hmeichhe dang ni âwm takin a rawn insiam dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ahijan chutia kawngkaa a lo luh laia a ke rah ri a han hriat veleh chuan, “Nang, Jeroboama nupui, lo lût rawh khai. Engtiziaa mi danga insiam nge i nih? Chanchin ṭha lo tak hrilh tûr chea tirh ka ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kal leh ta la, Jeroboama hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti: “Mipuite zîng ata ka chawisâng chia, ka mi Israel-te chungah hian hotuah ka siam chia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chhûngte ram ka chhuhsak a, chu chu ka pe chia; nimahsela, nang zawng ka chhiahhlawh Davida angin i awm ve lo va, ani zawngin ka thupêkte a pawm a, ka mit hmuha thil ṭha chauh tih tumin a thinlung zawng zawngin mi zui ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nang erawh chuan i hmaa mite zawng zawng aiin thil i tisual nasa bîk a, mi tihthinrim nân pathian dangte leh milem chhûnte i siam a, mi hnuchhawnsan ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chuvângin, ngai teh, Jeroboama chhûngkaw chungah hian thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlentîr ang a, Jeroboama aṭang hian mipa fa tawh phawt chu Israel rama mi, khuahkhirh leh khirh loh pawh ka tiboral ang a, miin êk a phiat fai hliau ang mai hian Jeroboama chhûngkua hi a mang vek hma loh chuan ka phiat bo hlauh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeroboama chhûngkaw zînga mi, khawpuia thi apiangte chu uiin an ei ang a, rama thi apiangte chu chunglêng savaten an ei ang; chu chu Lalpan a sawi tawh a ni,” ti ang che.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, tho la, i in lamah haw leh mai tawh. Khawpui chhûng i rah veleh naupang chu a thi dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-ho zawng zawngin an sûn ang a, an vui ang, Jeroboama chhûngkaw zîngah chuan amah chauh chu thlâna dah tûr a ni dâwn si a; Jeroboama chhûngkaw zîngah hian amah chauhvah hian Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chunga ṭhatna eng emaw a lan avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan tûn la laa Jeroboama chhûngkua rawn tiboraltu tûr Israel-te chunga lal a insiam ang; tûnah pawh hian engtin nge ni ta ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan tuia rairuang nghîng nghîng ang maiin Israel-te chu a rawn vaw nghîng ang a; tichuan, Lalpa thin tirima an Aseri-te chu an siam avângin an pute a lo pêk tawh, he ram ṭha tak ata hi Israel-hote chu a la pawt chhuak fai vek ang a, Lui piah lamah chuan a la tidarh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih, Jeroboama sualnate avângin Israel-hote chu a hawisan ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Jeroboama nupui chu a tho va, a chhuak ta a, Tirza khua a va thleng a; tin, in kawngka bul a va thlen chuan naupang chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a chhiahhlawh zâwlnei Ahija hmanga thu a lo sawi tawh ang ngei khân Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan an vui a, an sûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeroboama chanchin dang - a râl beih thûte, a rorêl thûte chu - ngai teh, Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeroboama rorêl chhûng chu kum 22 a ni; tin, a pute hnênah a muhîl a, a fapa Nadaba chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Solomona fapa Rehoboama chu Judai ramah a lal a. A lal ṭan tirh lai chuan Rehoboama chu kum sawmli leh kum khat mi a ni a, Lalpan a hming awmtîr nâna Israel hnam zawng zawngte zînga a thlan khawpui Jerusalem-ah chuan kum 17 a lal a. A nu hming chu Naami, Amon mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda-ho chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an ti a; an pute thiltih zawng zawng khûma an sualnate chuan a thikthu a chawh thawhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tlâng sâng tinah leh thing hring tin hnuaiah hian lungphunte phunin hmun sângte leh Aseri-te lam hi an siam bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chu ramah chuan mipa inzuarte pawh an awm a. Israel thlahte hmaa Lalpan a hnawh chhuah tâk hnamte thiltih tenawm tinrêng ang chu an ti ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lal Rehoboama lal kum nga kum chuan heti hi a ni a, Aigupta lal Sisakan Jerusalem khua chu a han bei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa ina rote leh lal ina rote chu a la a, a vai chuan a la ta vek a. Solomona rangkachak phaw siam zawng zawng chu a la tel vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Lal Rehoboama chuan chûng aiah chuan dâr phawte a siam a, lal in kawngka vêngtu hotute a kawltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, lal chu Lalpa ina a luh apiangin vêngtute chuan an keng a; tin, vêngtute pindanah an dah leh zêl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rehoboama chanchin dangte leh a thiltih zawng zawng chu, Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rehoboama leh Jeroboama chu indo rêng rêngin an awm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Rehoboama chu a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, Davida khawpuiah a pute zîngah chuan an phûm ta a. A nu hming chu Naami, Amon mi a ni. Tin, a fapa Abijama chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebata fapa Lal Jeroboama kum sâwm leh kum riat a lal kum chuan Juda-hote chungah Abijama chu a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaah kum thum a lal a. A nu hming chu Maaki, Abisaloma fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmaa a pain thil sual a tih zawng zawng kha a ti ve a; a pu Davida thinlung angin a thinlung chu Lalpa a Pathian lamah a ṭha famkim ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Davida avângin Lalpa a Pathianin a hnua a fapa la tundinna tûr leh, Jerusalem khua din nghet tûrin Jerusalem khuaah chuan khâwnvâr a neihtîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit mi Uria chungchâng tih lohvah chuan, Davidan Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a tih ṭhin avâng leh a dam chhûng zawnga ti tûra thu a pêk tawh phawt chu a hnial ngai hauh loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rehoboama chu a dam chhûng zawng Jeroboama nên an indo reng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abijama chanchin dangte leh a thiltih zawng zawng chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni lâwm ni? Tin, Abijama leh Jeroboama chu an indo ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Abijama chu a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a; tichuan, Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a. Tin, a aiawhin a fapa Asa chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel lal Jeroboama kum sawmhnih a lal kum chuan Asa chu Juda-hote chungah a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmli leh kum khat Jerusalem-ah a lal a. A nu hming chu Maaki, Abisaloma fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Asa chuan a pu Davida ang bawkin Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, mipa inzuarhote chu a ram ata a hnawt chhuak a, a putena milem an lo siam zawng zawng chu a thehthang bo vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a nu Maaki pawh chu, milem tenawm tak tak Aseri a siam avângin a lal nu nih a bân a. Tin, Asa chuan a milem siam chu a sât thlu a, Kidron luiah a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmun sângte erawh chu a thehthang bo lo va. Nimahsela, Asa thinlung chu a dam chhûng zawng Lalpa lamah a ṭha famkim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a pain thil a lo hlan sa tawhte leh, amah ngeiin a lo hlan tawh - tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungbêlte chu Lalpa inah a la lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Asa leh Israel lal Baasa chu an lal chhûng zawng an indo reng ṭhin a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Baasa chuan Juda-ho a han bei a, Juda lal Asa hnênah lût tûr leh chhuak tûr dan nân Rama khua a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Asan Lalpa in leh lal ina ro la awm, tangkarua leh rangkachak zawng zawng chu a la a, a chhiahhlawhte a pe a; tin, Lal Asa chuan Damaska khuaa awm Suria lal Heziona fa Tabrimona fapa Ben-hadada hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kei leh nanga kârah leh ka pa leh i pa kârah thuthlung a awm a. Ngai teh, lâwmman atân tangkarua leh rangkachak ka han thawn a che. Ti teh, Israel lal Baasa hian mi ṭînsanna tûrin a hnêna i thuthlun kha ṭhiat teh mai,” tiin a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ben-hadada chuan Lal Asa thu chu a lo pawm a; tichuan, Israel khuate chu bei tûrin a sipai hotute a tîr a, Ijon khua te, Dan khua te, Abel-beth-maaka khua te, Kineroth bial zawng zawng, Naphtali ram zawng zawngte nên a bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Baasan chumi thu chu a lo hriat veleh Rama khaw siam chu a bâng a, Tirza khuaah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Asa chuan Judai ram zawng zawngah thu a than vêl ta a; tu mah âwl rêng rêng an awm lo. Tichuan, Baasan Rama khaw siam nâna lung leh thing a hmante chu an thiar a; tin, chûng hmang chuan Lal Asan Mizpe khua leh Benjamin rama Geba khua a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asa chanchin dang zawng zawng te, a thiltihtheihzia zawng zawng te, a thiltih zawng zawng te, a khaw siamte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah chuan a chuang a ni lâwm ni? Amaherawhchu, a tar lamah a keah hri eng emaw a lo vei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Asa chu a pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pu Davida khawpuiah a pute zîngah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Jehosaphata chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Jeroboama fapa Nadaba chu Juda lal Asa lal kum hnihnaah chuan Israel-hote chungah a lal ṭan a, Israel-hote chungah kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuhin thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a, a pa kawng zawh chu a zawh ve a, Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih sualna kha a ti ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Isakara chhûngte zînga mi Ahija fapa Baasan amah a phiar ru a, Philistia-ho chan, Gibethon khuaah Baasa chuan a that ta a; Nadaba leh Israel-ho zawng zawngte chuan Gibethon khua chu an hual lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum thumnaah a ni, Baasa chuan a thaha, a aiawha a lal ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, lal a nih veleh chuan a tihchimih hma loh chuan Jeroboama chhûngte zawng zawng chu a that a, nung tawh phawt chu pakhat mah Jeroboama chu a zuahsak lo, Lalpan Silo khuaa mi a chhiahhlawh Ahija hmanga a lo sawi tawh ang khân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />chu chu Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih, Jeroboama sualnate avâng leh Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu a tihthinrim vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nadaba chanchin dangte leh a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Asa leh Israel lal Baasa chu an lal chhûng zawng an indo reng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum thumnaah chuan Ahija fapa Baasa chu Tirza khuaah Israel-ho zawng zawng chungah a lal ṭan a, kum sawmhnih leh kum li a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuhin thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a, Jeroboama kawng zawh chu a zawh ve a, Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a tih sualna kha a ti ve a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Baasa chungchâng thûah Hanania fapa Jehua hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vaivut ata ka chawisâng chia, ka mi Israel-te chungah hian hotuah ka siam chia; tin, nangin Jeroboama kawng zawh chu i zawh ve a, an sualnatea mi tihthinrim nân ka mi Israel-te thil i tihsualtîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ngai teh, Baasa leh a chhûngte hi ka tibo hlauh dâwn a ni; tichuan, Nebata fapa Jeroboama chhûngte ang maiin i chhûngte hi ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baasa chhûngkaw zînga mi khawpuia thi apiang chu uiin an ei ang a; tin, a chhûngkaw zînga mi rama thi apiangte chu chunglêng savaten an ei ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasa chanchin dang te, a thiltih te, a thiltihtheihziate chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Baasa chu a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, Tirza khuaah an phûm ta a. Tin, a fapa Ela chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Baasa leh a chhûngte chungchâng thûah chuan, a kutchhuaka Lalpa tihthinrim nâna Jeroboama chhûngte anna neia, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak a tih avâng leh amah chu a thah avângin, Hanania fapa zâwlnei Jehua hmanga a sawi Lalpa thu chu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum sawmhnih leh kum ruknaah chuan Baasa fapa Ela chu Tirza khuaan Israel-ho chungah a lal ṭan a, kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a puipa Zimria, a tawlailîr zâtve chunga hotuin a phiarru a; chutih lai chuan Tirza khuaah, Tirza khuaa a in chhûng lam hotu Arza inah a lo inin rui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum sawmhnih leh kum sarih kumah chuan Zimria chu a va lût a, a bei a, a that a, a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a han lal ṭana, a lalṭhutthlênga a han ṭhut veleh chuan, Baasa chhûngte zawng zawng chu a that vek a; a laichînte leh a ṭhiante zînga mi mipa fa tawh phawt chu pakhat mah a zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu an lawilohnaa tihthinrim nâna Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra an tih, Baasa sualna zawng zawng leh a fapa Ela sualnate avânga Lalpan zâwlnei Jehua hmanga Baasa chungchâng thûa a lo sawi tawh ang khân, Zimria chuan Baasa chhûngte zawng zawng chu a tiboral vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ela chanchin dangte leh a thiltih zawng zawngte chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum sawmhnih leh kum sarihnaah chuan Zimria chu Tirza khuaah ni sarih a lal a. Philistia-ho chan Gibbethon khua chu, mite chuan an hual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hualtute chuan Zimrian a phiarru a, lal a that ta tih an sawi an lo hria a; chutichuan, Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan sipai hotu Omria chu, chumi ni chuan an riahhmunah Israel-te chunga lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Omria chu Israel-ho zawng zawng nên Gibbethon khua aṭang chuan an han chho va, Tirza khua chu an han hual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Zimrian khua chu an la tih a hriat chuan lal ina kulhah a tlân lût a, lal inah chuan a inhâl khum a, a thi ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo tak tia a sualnate avâng leh, Jeroboama kawng zawh chu zawh vea Israel-hote thil tihsualtîra a sualna avangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zimria chanchin dangte leh, a phiarrûkna thute chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lawm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mipuite chu pâwl hnihah an lo inṭhen ta a: mipui zâtve chuan Ginatha fapa Tibnia chu lala siam tumin an zui a, a zâtvein Omria an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Omria zuitute chuan Ginatha fapa Tibnia zuitute chu an hneh ta a. Tichuan, Tibnia chu a thi a, Omria chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum sawmthum leh kum khatnaah Omria chu Israel-te chungah a lal ṭan a, kum sâwm leh kum hnih a lal a. Tirza khuaah kum ruk a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Semera ta Samari tlâng chu tangkaraw talent hnihin a lei a; tin, tlângah chuan khua a siam a, a khaw siam hmingah chuan chumi tlâng neitu Semera hming chawiin Samari a puttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Omria chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a, a hmaa mite zawng zawng aiin thil a tisual nasa bîk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama dân zawng zawng kha a la a, an lawilohna avânga Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian tihthinrim nâna Israel-hote thil a tihsualtîrna ang khân a sual ve si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Omria thiltih chanchin dangte leh a thiltihtheihzia a tihlan thute chu, Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Omria chu a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl a, Samari khuaah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Ahaba chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum sawmthum leh kum riatnaah Omria fapa Ahaba chu Israel-te chungah a lal ṭan a; tin, Omria fapa Ahaba chu Samari khuaan kum sawmhnih leh kum hnih Israel-te chungah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Omria fapa Ahaba chuan a hmaa mite zawng zawng aiin Lalpa mit hmuhin thil ṭha lo tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Nebata fapa Jeroboama sualna ang tih ve te chu eng mah lova ngai ni âwm takin, Zidon-ho lal Ethbaala fanu Jezebeli nupuiah a nei a, Baala rawng te bâwlsanin a be ve ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Samari khuaa Baala in a sakah chuan Baala tân maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Ahaba chuan Aseri a siam a, a hmaa Israel lalte zawng zawng aiin Ahaba chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian tihthinrimna thil a ti nasa bîk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A lal lai chuan Bethel mi Hielan Jeriko khua a siam a. A fa tîr Abirama chânin a lungphûm chu a phûm a; tin, a fa tlum Seguba chânin a kulh kawngkhârte chu a din a, Lalpan Nuna fapa Josua hmanga a lo sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tisbe khua, Gilead rama Tisbe khuaa mi Elijan Ahaba hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa , a bula ka awm ṭhinna Israel-te Pathian nunna chhâlin ka sawi e: kum eng emaw ti chhûng chu ka thu lo chuan dai leh ruah rêng rêng a tla lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu a hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Heta ta hi chhuak la, khawchhak lam panin kal la, Jordan bula awm Kerith luiah han biru rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, chumi lui tui chu i tlân ang a; chuta a châwm tûr chein choâkte thu ka pe tawh e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, a kal a, Lalpa thu ang chuan a ti ta a; Jordan bula awm Kerith luiah chuan a han awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, choâkten zîng lamah chhang leh sa an rawn putsak ṭhîn a, tlai lamah chhang leh sa an rawn putsak leh ṭhîn a; tin, lui tui chu a tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, nakin deuhvah chuan heti hi a ni a, chûng ramah chuan ruah rêng rêng a sûr loh avângin lui chu a lo kang chat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu a hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tho la, Zidon rama Zarephath khuaah kal la, chutah chuan awm rawh. Ngai teh, a châwm tûr chein hmeithai pakhat thu ka pe tawh e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, a tho va, Zarephath khuaah chuan a kal ta a; tin, chumi khaw kulh kawngka chu a va thlen chuan, ngai teh, hmeithai pakhat thing fawm hi a lo awm a. Tin, ani chu a han au va, “Bêlin tui tlêm tê mi han lâk teh khai, ka lo in ang e,” a han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, la tûra a kal chu a han au va, “Chhang tlêm tê pawh mi han ken teh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa i Pathian nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, chhang zawng ka nei lo va, bêlah chhangphut vei khat lek leh, ûmah sahriak tlêm tê chauh ka nei a; tin, ngai teh, ka hâwna ka tân leh ka fapa tâna siamna tûrin thing ṭang pahnih emaw lek ka fawm a ni a; tichuan, kan ei ang a, kan thi mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Elijan a hnênah, “Hlau suh; i sawi ang chuan va ti ta che; amaherawhchu, chumi chuan chhang tê tak tê mi han siamsak phawt la, chu chu mi rawn lâk la, chumi zawhah chuan i tân leh i fapa tân i la siam dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti a ni: ‘ Lalpan lei chungah hian ruah a rawn sûrtîr hma loh chuan chhangphut bêl chu a ruak chuang lo vang a, sahriak ûm pawh a kang lo vang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Elija sawi ang chuan a va ti a; tin, amah leh a chhûngte leh Elija nên chuan ni eng emaw zât an ei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elija hmanga a sawi Lalpa thu ang khân chhangphut bêl chu a ruak chuang lo va, sahriak ûm pawh a kang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chûng thil hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, in neitunu, hmeichhe fapa chu a lo damlo ta a; a na chu a na hle mai a, a thaw a tâwp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Elija hnênah, “Aw nang Pathian mi, nang leh kei hi eng nge maw kan nih? Ka sualna mi hriat chhuahtîr tûr leh ka fapa mi thahsak tûra lo kal i nih hi le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “I fapa chu mi han pe teh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a pawm lai chu a lâksak a, a awmna pindanah chuan a pawm chho va, ama khumah a muttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa a au va, “Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, ka chênna hmeithainu chungah pawh hian a fapa tihhlumsakin thil ṭha lo i rawn thlentîr ta em ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, naupang chungah chuan vawi thum a bawk a, Lalpa chu a au va, “Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, khawngaih takin he naupang nunna hi amahah hian han awmtîr leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Elija thu chu a lo ngaihthlâksak a; tichuan, naupang nunna chu amahah chuan a lo awm leh a, a lo harh leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan naupang chu a hruai a, pindan ata chu in chhûngah a chhukpui a, a nu a pe ta a; tin, Elijan, “En teh, i fapa hi a dam leh ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan Elija hnênah, “Tunah zet chuan Pathian mi i ni a, i kâa Lalpa thu hi thutak a ni tih ka lo hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni rei fe hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, a kum thum kumah chuan Lalpa thu Elija hnênah a lo thleng a, “Va kal la, Ahaba hnênah va inlan rawh; tichuan, lei chungah hian ruah ka rawn sûrtîr dâwn e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Elija chu Ahaba hnêna inlan tûr chuan a kal ta a. Samari ramah chuan ṭâm chu a nasa hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Ahaban Obadia, a in chhûng lam hotu chu a ko va (Obadia chu Lalpa ṭih mi tak a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />heti hi a ni a, Jezebelin Lalpa zâwlneite a râwt chiam lai khân Obadia chuan zâwlnei za a hruai a, pûkah sawmnga têlin a thukru a, chhang leh tuiin a châwm ṭhîn a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Ahaba chuan Obadia hnênah, “Tuihna zawng zawng leh luikawr zawng zawng awmna lam ram va fang teh khai; sakawr leh sabengtungte hi kan chhandam theihna tûrin hlobet te kan hmuhsak thei mahna; chuti lo chuan, rante hi kan chân vek dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram fan chhuah tûr an insem a; Ahaba chu amahin kawng pakhatah a kal a, Obadia chu amahin kawng dangah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chutia Obadia a kal lai chuan, ngai teh, Elija nên an intâwk a; tin, ani chuan a la hria a; tichuan, a bawkkhup a, “Nang i ni maw, ka pu Elija?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ni e; kal ta la, ‘Ngai teh, Elija sâwtah sâwn a awm e,’ tiin i pu va hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Thil eng nge ka tihsuala, i chhiahhlawh hi thah tûra Ahaba kuta pêk i duh mai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka puin nangmah zawntîr lohna hnam leh ram rêng rêng a nei lo asin; ‘Hetah a awm lo ve,’ an tih chuan an hmuh loh che thûah ram leh hnam chu chhia a chhamtîr zêl mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah hian nangin, ‘Kal ta la, ngai teh, “Elija sâwtah sâwn a awm e,” tiin i pu va hrilh rawh,’ i ti mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Heti hi a ni ang a, ka kalsan veleh che hian Lalpa thlarauvin ka hriat lohnaah a la bo si ang chia; tichuan, Ahaba ka va hrilha, a rawn hmuh theih si loh che chuan mi that mai ang asin. Nimahsela, i chhiahhlawh hian ka tleirâwl tirh ata Lalpa chu ka ṭih ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jezebelin Lalpa zâwlneite a râwt chiam laia ka thiltih, Lalpa zâwlneite zînga mi za, sawmnga têla pûka ka thuhrûka, chhang leh tuia ka châwm zia te kha ka pu hi an hrilh lo che em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûnah hian nangin, ‘Kal ta la, ngai teh, “Elija chu sâwtah sâwn a awm e,” tiin i pu va hrilh rawh,’ i ti mai a; mi that ngei ang le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan, “A bula ka awm ṭhinna Sipaihote Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, vawiinah hian a hnênah ka inlan ngei ngei dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Obadia chu Ahaba be tûrin a kal a, a va hrilh ta a; tin, Ahaba chu Elija hmuh tumin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ahaban Elija a va hmuh chuan Ahaban a hnênah, “Nang i ni maw, Israel-ho timangangtupa?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Israel-ho ka timangang lo ve; nang leh i pa chhûngten alâwm timangang zâwk ni, Lalpa thupêkte hi hawisana, Baala-te i pawm zâwkah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûnah hian Israel-ho zawng zawng leh Baala zâwlnei zali leh sawmnga leh, Aseri zâwlnei, Jezebeli dawhkâna chawhlui kîl ve ṭhîn zalite kha ka hnênah Karmel tlângah hian va koh khâwmtîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahaba chuan Israel thlahteho zawng zawng hnênah mi a tîr a, zâwlneihote chu Karmel tlângah chuan a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan mipuiho zawng zawng chu a va hnaih a, “Tuilairapin eng chen nge in awm dâwn? Lalpa chu Pathian a nih chuan, amah chu zui ula; tin, Baala a nih leh, amah chu zui rawh u,” a ti a. Mipuite chuan kam khat mahin an chhâng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Elija chuan mipuite hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa zâwlnei la awm chu keimah chauh hi ka ni a; Baala zâwlneite erawh chu mi 450 an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, bâwngpa pahnih mi han pe sela; annin bâwngpa pakhat chu an pualah thlang sela, chan sawm sela, thing chungah chuan dah sela, a hnuaiah mei chhêm lovin; tin, keiin bâwngpa pakhat chu ka buatsaih ve ang a, thing chungah chuan ka dah ang a, mei ka chhêm bîk lo vang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, nangnin in pathian hming chu lam ula, kei pawhin Lalpa hming ka lam ang a; tichuan, meia rawn chhângtu Pathian apiang chu Pathian ni rawh se,” a ti a. Tin, mi zawng zawng chuan an chhâng a, “A dik alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Elija chuan Baala zâwlneite hnênah chuan, “Nangnin bâwngpa pakhat hi in pualah thlang ula, buatsaih hmasa rawh u, nangni zawng in tam deuh hi; tin, in pathian hming chu lam ula; amaherawhchu, a hnuaiah mei chhêm suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, bâwngpa an pual chu an la a, an buatsaih a, “Aw Baala, min han chhâng rawh khai,” tiin zîng aṭangin chhûn thlengin Baala hming chu an lam a. Nimahsela, aw riva rêng rêng a awm lo va, chhângtu rêng rêng lah an awm hek lo. Tin, an maichâm siam vêlah chuan an zuang an zuang mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chhûn lai takah chuan heti hi a ni a, Elija chuan anmahni chu tielin, “Au ring che u le, pathian a ni si a; a inngaihtuah rih emaw, a bi bo rih lawk emaw, a thang bo rih emaw, a nih loh leh a muhîl hlauhva, tihharh tûr emaw a ni ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ring takin an au va, an tih ṭhin dânin chemtê leh feitein thi chhuak zawih zawih khawpin an inzaiin an invit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ni a lo thlangher chuan heti hi a ni a, tlai lam inthawi hun thlengin an sawi dual dual mai a; nimahsela, aw riva rêng rêng a awm lo va, chhângtu tûr rêng rêng emaw, a lo ngaihsaktu rêng rêng emaw an awm bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Elija chuan mipuiho zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Mi rawn hnaih teh u khai,” a ti a; tin, mipuiho zawng zawng chuan an va hnaih a. Tin, Lalpa maichâm tihchim tawh chu a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, “I hming chu Israela a ni ang,” tia Lalpa thu lo dawngtu Jakoba fate hnam zât lung sâwm leh pahnih Elija chuan a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, lungte chuan Lalpa hmingin maichâm a siam a; tin, maichâm vêl chu buh chi tehkhâwng hnih leng zetin a lai khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, thing chu a han chhep fel a, bâwngpa chu a chan sawm a, thing chungah chuan a dah a. Tin, “Bêl pali tuiin tikhat ula, hâlral thilhlan leh thing hi han leih rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, “Han leih leh rawh u,” a ti a, an han leih leh a. Tin, “Han leih nawn leh rawh u,” a ti a, an han leih nawn leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, tui chu maichâm vêlah chuan a luang ta dûl dûl a; tin, laih khuar chu tuiin a tikhat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, tlai lam inthawi hun lai chuan heti hi a ni a, zâwlnei Elija chuan a va pan hnai a, “Aw Lalpa , Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Israela te Pathian, nang hi Israel rama Pathian i nih leh, kei hi i chhiahhlawh ka niha, hêng zawng zawng hi nangma thûa ti ka nih vawiinah hian hre hlawm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi lo ngaihthlâksak la, hêng mipuite hian nang Lalpa hi Pathian i ni a, an thinlungte i lamlêttîr leh ta a ni tih hi an lo hriat theih nân aw Lalpa , mi lo ngaihthlâksak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa mei chu a lo tla a, hâlral thilhlan te, thing te, lung te, vaivut te chu a kâng ral a, laih khuara tui chu a hîp kang ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho zawng zawngin chu chu an han hmuh chuan an bawkkhup a, “ Lalpa hi a lo ni, Pathian chu! Lalpa hi a lo ni, Pathian chu! Lalpa hi a lo ni, Pathian chu!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Elija chuan an hnênah, “Baala zâwlneite hi man ula, pakhat mah chhuah suh u,” a ti a. Tin, an man a, Elija chuan Kison luiah a hruai thla a, chutah chuan a that hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, Elija chuan Ahaba hnênah, “Han chho ta langin, eiin han in tawh rawh; ruahpui sûr tûr thâwm a awm a nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahaba chu ei leh in tûrin a han chho ta a. Tin, Elija chu Karmel tlâng chhîp lamah a han chho va; tin, lei lamah a kûn a, a kapkârah a hmai a rawlh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “Han chho ta la, tuifinriat lam han thlîr teh khai,” a ti a. Tin, a han chho va, a han thlîr a; “Eng mah a awm lo,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Kal leh rawh, vawi sarih,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, a vawi sarihnaah chuan heti hi a ni a, “Ngai teh, tuifinriat aṭangin mihring kut tiat lek chhûm a chho nel nel e,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Han kal ta la, Ahaba hnênah, ‘I tawlailîr buatsaih la, chhuk tawh rawh, ruahin a dang dah ang che,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, rei lo têah chuan heti hi a ni a, vân chu thli leh chhûmin a lo duk ta kuih mai a, ruahpui vânâwn a lo sûr ta a. Tin, Ahaba chu tawlailîra chuangin Jezreel khuaah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa kut chu Elija chungah a awm a; tichuan, a puan a veng a, Ahaba hmaah chuan Jezreel khaw luhna thlengin a tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ahaba chuan Elija thiltih zawng zawng, khandaiha zâwlnei zawng zawng a thah thûte nên Jezebeli a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Jezebeli chuan Elija hnênah, “Kha mite zînga mi pakhat nunna ang khân, naktûk hetih hun hmaa i nunna ka siamsak ve loh che chuan pathianten an tih tihin mi ti mai sela, chu aia nasa pawhin,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, a hlau va, a tho va, a tlânchhe ta a, Judai rama Beer-seba khua a va thleng a, chutah chuan a chhiahhlawh a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani erawh chu thlalêrah ni khat banah a kal a, Juniper thing hnuaiah a ṭhu a. Tin, thih a dîl ta a, “A tâwk ta e, aw Lalpa , tûnah hian ka nunna hi la mai teh, ka pute aiin ka ṭha chuang bîk si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Juniper thing hnuaiah chuan a mu a, a muhîl ta a; tin, ngai teh, vântirhkoh hian a rawn khawih a, a hnênah, “Tho la, ei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a han en vêl a, ngai teh, a lû bulah chuan chhangpêr, lung sâa hem hmin diam leh tuithâwl hi a lo awm a. Tichuan, a ei a, a in a, a mu leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a lo kal nawn leh a, a rawn khawih a, “Tho la, ei rawh, i kalna tûr i chelh lo vang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, a eiin a in a; tichuan, chu chaw avâng chuan Pathian tlâng Horeb thlengin ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chuta pûk pakhat chu a va thleng a, chutah chuan a awm ta a; tin, ngai teh, Lalpa thu a hnênah a lo thleng a, a hnênah, “Hetah hian eng nge i tih, Elija?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan, “ Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian tân hian ṭhahnem ka ngai êm êm ṭhîn a; Israela thlahte chuan i thuthlung an hawisan a, i maichâmte an tichim a, i zâwlneite khandaihin an sât hlum si a. A la awm chu keimah chauh hi ka ni a; ka nunna mi lâksak an tum a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Va chhuak la, tlângah sâwn Lalpa hmaah va ding rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ngai teh, Lalpa a lo kal a, thlipui na takin tlângte chu Lalpa hmaah chuan a rawn chhêm khî a, lungpuite chu a phel rem rum a; nimahsela, thli-ah chuan Lalpa chu a awm lo. Tin, thli tleh zawh chuan lîr a lo nghîng a; nimahsela, lîrnghîngah chuan Lalpa chu a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lîrnghîn zawh chuan mei a lo chhuak a; nimahsela, meiah chuan Lalpa chu a awm lo. Tin, mei zawhah chuan aw dam diai hi a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Elijan chu chu a hriat chuan a puanin a hmai a khuh a, a va chhuak a, pûk kawngkaah a va ding a. Tin, ngai leh, awin a hnênah, “Hetah hian eng nge i tih, Elija?” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian tân hian ṭhahnem ka ngai êm êm ṭhîn a, Israela thlahte lah chuan i thuthlung an hawisan a, i maichâmte an tichim a, i zâwlneite khandaihin an sât hlum si a. A la awm chu keimah chauh hi ka ni a, ka nunna mi lâksak an tum a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a hnênah, “Haw leh ta langin, thlalêr lamah Damaska khuaan kal rawh; i va thlen chuan Suria lal atân Hazaela hriak i thih ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal atân Nimsia fapa Jehua hriak i thih ang a; tin, i aiawha zâwlnei ni tûrin Abel-mehola khuaa mi Saphata fapa Elisa hriak i thih bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Hazaela khandaih pumpelh apiang chu Jehuan a that ang a; tin, Jehua khandaih pumpelh apiang chu Elisan a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Israel ramah hian Baala hmaa la ṭhingṭhi ngai lo leh, la fâwp ngai lo mi sângsarih ka tân ka hum dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, chuta ta chu a chhuak a, Saphata fapa Elisa chu a va hmu a, ani chuan lei a lo let a, a hmaah chuan sebâwng tuak sâwm leh tuak hnih a awm a, a sâwm leh pahnihna chu amahin a lo khalh a; tin, Elija chuan a va pan a, a puan a va bahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, sebâwngte chu a kalsan a, Elija chu a ûm a, “Ka nu leh ka pa ka va fâwp rih zet ang e aw; tichuan, ka rawn zui ang che,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Va haw leh ta che, eng nge ka tih che kha le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a va zui chu a hâwng a, sebâwng tuak khat a khalha chu a talh a, a sa chu sebâwng thuamhnawte chuan a chhûm a, mite a sem a, an ei ta a. Tichuan, a tho va, Elija chu a ûm a, a rawng a bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal Ben-hadada chuan a sipaiho zawng zawng a khâwm vek a; lal sawmthum leh pahnih an tel a, sakawr leh tawlailîrte nên a han chho va, Samari khua a han hual a, a han bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba hnênah chuan khawpui chhungah mi a tîr a, a hnênah, “Ben-hadadan heti hian a ti,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘I tangkarua leh i rangkachakte kha ka ta a ni e; i nupuite leh i fate, a ṭha ṭhate chenin ka ta a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan a lo chhâng a, “Aw lalber, ka pu, i sawi ang chuan a ni alâwm; keimah leh ka neih zawng zawng chu i ta a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a mi tirhte chu an lo kal leh a, “Ben-hadadan heti hian a ti, ‘I hnênah, “I tangkarua te, i rangkachak te, i nupuite, i fate chu mi pe tûr a ni,” tiin mi ka rawn tîr tak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nimahsela, naktûk hetih hun vêlah hian ka mite i hnênah ka rawn tîr ang a, i in leh i mite in chu an rawn dap dâwn a ni. Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, i mit la apiangte chu an la ang a, an rawn kalpui vek ang,’ tiin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel lal chuan a rama upaho zawng zawng chu a ko va, “Lo hre teh u khai, he mi hian thil ṭha lo tak tih a tum zia hi; ka hnênah mi a rawn tîr a, ka nupuite, ka fate, ka tangkarua te, ka rangkachak te a rawn ngên a, ka lo hnial pawh a ni si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, upaho zawng zawng leh mipuiho zawng zawng chuan a hnênah, “Lo bengkhawn duh suh, rem pawh ti hek suh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ben-hadada mi tirhte hnênah chuan, “Lalber ka pu hnênah chuan, ‘I chhiahhlawh hnêna mi tîra i rawn ngen hmasak zawng zawng ang kha chuan ka ti ang a; amaherawhchu, hei hi zawng ka ti thei lo vang, a ti e,’ ti rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, a mi tirhte chu an kal leh ta a, chumi thu chu an va thlen leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Ben-hadada chuan a hnênah mi a tîr leh a, “Ka hnung zuitute zawng zawng hian Samari khaw vaivut vei khat ṭheuh pawh an hmuh theih dâwn chuan, pathianten an tih tihin mi ti sela, chu aia nasa pawhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan a chhâng a, “ ‘Mi a inrâlthuam lai rengin, a inrâlthuamna hlîp thla tawh ang rengin an uang ngai lo ve,’ tiin va hrilh rawh u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, amah leh lalten bûktêa zu an lo in ho laiin chumi thu chu Ben-hadada chuan a lo hria a, a mite hnênah chuan, “Insiam rawh u khai,” a ti a. Tichuan, khaw bei tûr chuan an insiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, zâwlnei pakhat hian Israel lal Ahaba chu a va hnaih a, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Hêng mipui tam tak hi i hmu em? Ngai teh, vawiinah hian i kutah ka pe dâwn a ni; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Ahaban, “Tu hmangin maw?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘Ram ṭhentea hotute tlangvâlho hmang hian,’ tiin,” a ti a. Tichuan, ani chuan, “Tuin nge râl rêl ang?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Nangmahin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan ram ṭhentea hotute tlangvâlho chu a han khâwm a, zahnih leh sawmthum leh pahnih an ni a; tin, chung mite zawhah chuan mi zawng zawng, Israela thlahte zawng zawng chu a khâwm a, sângsarih an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chhûnlai takah hian an va chhuak ta a. Ben-hadada leh lalho, amah ṭanpuitu lal sawmthum leh pahnihte erawh chu bûktêah an lo inin rui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ram ṭhentea hotute tlangvâlho chu an va chhuak hmasa a; tin, Ben-hadada chuan mi a tîr a, anni chuan, “Samari khua aṭanga lo chhuak an awm e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Inrem tuma lo kal an nih leh a nungin lo man ula; indo tuma lo kal an nih leh a nung bawkin lo man rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, chûngho, ram ṭhentea hotute tlangvâlho leh a rawn zuitu sipaihote chu khua ata an chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, an va bitum ṭheuh chu an va that a; tichuan, Suria-ho chu an tlânchhe ta a, Israel-ho chuan an ûm a; tin, Suria lal Ben-hadada chu sakawr chunga chuangin sakawr chung chuang mite nên an tlân chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chu a va chhuak a, sakawr leh tawlailîrte chu a va bei a, Suria-ho chu a that chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei chuan Israel lal chu a va hnaih a, a hnênah, “Intichak sauh sauh langin, i tih dân tûr ngaihtuah rawh khai, kum a lo vei hian Suria lal chuan a rawn bei leh dâwn che a nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal hote chuan a hnênah, “An pathian hi tlâng pathian a ni a; chuvângin, keimahni aiin an chak a nih hi. Phaizâwlah bei tawh ila, anni ai chuan kan chak zâwk ngei ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hetiang hian ti ang che: lalho hi an zavaiin thlâk vek la, an aiah ram awptute dah langin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tin, sipaiho sakawr leh tawlailîr te, i chân tâk zât chiah kha sipaiho din ṭha leh ang che; tichuan, phaizâwlah kan bei ang a, anni ai chuan kan chak zâwk ngei ang e,” an ti a. Tin, an thu chu a pawm a, chutiang chuan a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a kum lehah chuan heti hi a ni a, Ben-hadada chuan Suria-ho chu a khâwm a, Israel-hote bei tûrin Aphek khuaah a han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu an pung khâwm a, ei tûr te an chhêk tê tê a, bei tûrin an thawk ta a; tin, Israela thlahte chuan kêlno tlêm tê tê rual hnih ang lek hian an va ep ve a; Suria-hote erawh chu a ram khahin an khat mup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mi chuan Israel lal chu a va hnaih a, a va bia a, a hnênah, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Suria-hovin, “ Lalpa chu tlâng Pathian a ni a, ruam Pathian zawng a ni lo va,” an ti a ni; chuvângin, hêng mipui tam takte hi i kutah ka pe dâwn e; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih chhûng zet chu an inep reng a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni sarih ni chuan an inbei ta a; tin, Israela thlahte chuan Suria mite chu ni khatah sipai nuai khat an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi dangte erawh chu Aphek-ah, khawpui chhûngah an tlân lût a, a la awmate chu mi sînghnih leh sângsarih kulh chimin a delh hlawm a. Tin, Ben-hadada chu a tlânchhia a, khawpui chhûngah pindan chhûngrilan a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, a hoten a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Israela chhûngkaw zînga lalte hi mi khawngaih thei tak lal an ni tih thu kan hria a. Saiip puan fêngin, kan lûah hruia inhlîngin Israel lal hnênah min va kaltîr rawh khai; ani chuan a zuah duh mial mahna che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, saiip puan an fêng a, an lûah hruiin an hlîng a, Israel lal hnênah chuan an va kal a, “I chhiahhlawh Ben-hadadan, ‘Khawngaih takin mi zuah rawh se,’ a ti e,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “A la dam a ni maw? Ka unaupa a ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chu mite chuan ngaihṭha takin, a rilru thu tak a sawi a ni ang tih ringin, “I unaupa Ben-hadada ni e,” an ti var a. Tichuan, ani chuan, “Va kal ula, rawn hruai rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Ben-hadada chu a lo chhuak a, a hnênah a kal a; tin, ani chuan tawlailîrah a lo chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Ben-hadada chuan a hnênah, “Ka pain i pa laka khua a lo lâk tâkte kha ka pe kîr leh ang a; tin, ka pain Samari khuaa dâwrpui hmun a siam ang khân Damaska khuaah i dâwrpui hmun tûr i siam ve dâwn nia,” a ti a. Tin, Ahaba chuan, “Chutianga thu inthlung chuan ka kaltîr ang che,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a hnênah thu a thlung a, a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei fapate zînga mi pakhat hian Lalpa thuin a ṭhianpa hnênah, “Mi han vaw teh khai,” a ti a. Tin, chu mi chuan a vaw duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, a hnênah, “ Lalpa thu i âwih loh avângin, ngai teh, nang hian mi liamsan veleh, sakeibakneiin a lo seh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, a liamsan tâk veleh chuan sakeibakneiin a lo hmu a, a seh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, mi dang a va hmu leh a, “Mi han vaw teh khai,” a ti a. Chu mi chuan a han vua a, a vaw sil ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, zâwlnei chu a kal a, kalkawngah lal a lo châng a, a chal hrênnaa a mit khuhin a inbâwl danglam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, lal a lo thlen chuan lal chu a lo au va, “I chhiahhlawh hi indona rûnpui hmunah ka va kal a; tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat hi a lo hawi a, ka hnênah mi pakhat a rawn hruai a, ‘He mi hi lo vêng rawh; a tlân bo hlauh zawngin a nun aiah i nun i chân ang a, a nih loh leh tangkarua talent khat i pe tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, i chhiahhlawh hi ka buai vêl chung avângin a lo bo ta daih mai a,” a ti a. Tin, Israel lal chuan a hnênah, “Chutiang tak chu a ni, i chunga thu tlu chu; nangmahin zuk titlu tawh diam chia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a mit ata chal hrênna chu a hlîm ta thuai a; tin, Israel lal chuan zâwlneite zînga mi a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka ânchhe lawha chu i chhuah tâk avângin a nun aiah i nun, a mite aiah i mite i chân ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chu ngui tak leh lungni lo takin a haw a, Samari khuaah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng thil hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Jezreel mi Nabothan grêp huan a nei a, chu chu Jezreel-ah Samari lal Ahaba in bul lawkah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Ahaban Nabotha chu, “Ka in bul a nih avâng hian, thlai hmunah i grêp huan hi mi pe rawh khai, a aiah grêp huan ṭha zâwk ka pe ang che; a nih loh leh i duh zâwk phei chuan a tangkain a man tâwk chu ka pe ang che,” tiin a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Nabotha chuan Ahaba hnênah, “Ka pute ro han pêk che chu ka tân a âwmin a âwm lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jezreel mi Nabothan chutiang thu a hnêna a sawi avâng chuan Ahaba chu ngui tak leh lungni lo takin a inah a lût ta a, “Ka pute ro ka pe thei lo vang che,” a ti tlat si a. Tichuan, a khumah a mu a, lehlam a hawi a, chaw rêng rêng a ei duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, a nupui Jezebeli chu a va kal a, a hnênah, “Engtizia nge i rilru chuti taka a lungngaiha, chaw rêng rêng i ei loh le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Jezreel mi Nabotha ka bia a, a hnênah, ‘I grêp huan hi mi leitîr rawh, a nih loh leh i duh zâwk chuan a aiah grêp huan dang ka pe ang che,’ ka ti a; tin, ani chuan, ‘Ka grêp huan zawng ka pe lo vang che,’ tiin mi chhâng alâwm maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a nupui Jezebeli chuan a hnênah, “Israel ram lal hi i ni lâwm ni? Tho la, chaw ei la, rilru hlim takin awm rawh khai; Jezreel mi Nabotha grêp huan chu keiman ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahaba hmingin lehkha a ziak a, nemnain a nem a; tin, lehkha chu a awmna khuaa Nabotha ṭhenawm upate leh mi ṭhate hnênah a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaah chuan, “Chaw nghei thu lo puang ulangin, mipui zîngah Nabotha chu hmatâwntîr ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi pahnih Beliala fate a hmaah ṭhuttîr ula, ‘Pathian leh lal i sawi chhia a ni,’ tia a hêktu atân lo siam rawh u. Tin, hruai chhuak ula, lo dêng hlum rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a awmna khuaa mi, a awmna khuaa awm upate leh mi ṭhate chuan Jezebelin an hnêna a thawn lehkhaa a ziak ang chuan an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chaw nghei thu an puang a, mipui zîngah Nabotha chu an hmatâwntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, mi pahnih Beliala fapate chu a hmaah chuan an va ṭhu a; tin, Beliala mite chuan mipuiho hmaah chuan, “Nabotha hian Pathian leh lal a sawi chhia e,” tiin amah Nabotha chu an hêk a. Tichuan, khua ata an hruai chhuak a, lungin an dêng a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Jezebeli hnênah, “Nabotha chu lungin an dêng a, a thi ta e,” tiin mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jezebelin Nabotha chu lungin an dêng a, a thi ta tih a hriatin heti hi a ni a, Jezebeli chuan Ahaba hnênah, “Tho la, Jezreel mi Nabotha grêp huan, a leitîr phal loh che kha nei tawh rawh le; Nabotha chu a dam tawh lo, a thi tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Ahaban Nabotha a thi ta tih a hriatin heti hi a ni a, Jezreel mi Nabotha grêp huan nei tûra thawk thla tûrin Ahaba chu a tho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Tisbe mi Elija hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tho la, Samari khuaa awm Israel lal Ahaba be tûrin zuk kal rawh khai. Ngai teh, Nabotha grêp huanah a awm a, neih tumin chutah chuan a chhuk a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnênah, ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti, “I that a, i neihsak lehnghâl elo?” tiin,’ ti langin; a hnênah, ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti, “Uiin Nabotha thisen an liahna hmun ngeiah hian nanga thisen pawh hi an liak ve dâwn a ni,” tiin,’ ti ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ahaba chuan Elija hnênah, “Mi rawn hmu ta maw, ka hmêlmapa?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ka hmu ta che a nih hi, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo ti tûrin inhralh ta hek che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai teh, i chungah hian thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlentîr ang a, ka rawn tibo hlauh ang chia, Ahaba aṭang hian mipa fa tawh phawt chu Israel rama mi khuahkhirh leh khirh loh pawh ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangin mi tihthinrim avâng leh Israel-ho thil i tihsualtîr avângin, Nebata fapa Jeroboama chhûngte leh Ahija fapa Baasa chhûngte ang maiin i chhûngte hi ka siam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Jezebeli chungchâng thu pawh Lalpan a sawi a, “Jezreel khaw kulh bulah uiin Jezebeli hi an la ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngkaw zînga mi khawpuia thi apiangte chu uiin an ei ang a; rama thi apiangte chu chunglêng savaten an ei ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nupui Jezebeli fuihpawrha Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo ti tûra inpe, Ahaba ang rêng rêng hi tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpan Israela thlahte hmaa a hnawh chhuah Amor-hote thiltih tinrêng ang milemte biain thil tenawm takin a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Ahaban chûng thu a hriat chuan heti hi a ni a, a puan a pawt thlêr a, saiip puan a sin a, chaw a nghei a, saiip puanah a mu a, dîm takin a che ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Tisbe mi Elija hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ahaba ka hmaa a inngaihtlâwmzia hi i hmu em? Ka hmaa a inngaihtlâwm avâng hian ama chhanah hi chuan thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr lo vang a, a fapa chhanah erawh chuan a chhûngte chungah thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kum thum chhûng chu Suria-ho leh Israel-hote chu indo lovin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a kum thum kum chuan heti hi a ni a, Juda lal Jehosaphata chu Israel lal hnênah a zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan a puipate hnênah, “Ramoth-gilead khua hi keimahni ta a ni tih hre reng sia engtia Suria lal hi chhuhsak lova awm mai mai nge kan nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata hnênah chuan, “Ramoth-gilead khua mi han beihpui ve duh ang emaw chu?” a ti a. Tin, Jehosaphatan Israel lal hnênah chuan, “Kei leh nang, ka mite leh i mite chu pumkhat kan ni a, ka sakawrte leh i sakawrte chu pumkhat an ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chuan Israel lal hnênah, “ Lalpa thu ngaichâng rih zet la maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel lal chuan zâwlneiho mi zali lai a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Ramoth-gilead khua bei tûrin ka han thawk ang nge thawk lo vang?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Han thawk rawh, Lalpan lal kutah a pe dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jehosaphatan, “Hetah hian Lalpa zâwlnei dang tu emaw tal han râwn tûr an awm lo vem ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Jehosaphata hnênah, “ Lalpa min râwnsak tûr mi pakhat, Imla fapa Mikaia zawng a la awm kha maw! Nimahsela, ani hi chu ka huat zâwng tak a ni, ka chungchâng thu hi a chhe lam ngawt lo chu a ṭha rêng rêng a sawi ngai si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel lal chuan hotu pakhat a han ko va, “Imla fapa Mikaia han hruai thuai teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal leh Juda lal Jehosaphata chu Samari kulh kawngka luhna bula hruih zâwlah an lal puana inthuamin, an lalṭhutthlêng ve veah an ṭhu a; tin, zâwlnei zawng zawng chuan an hmaah thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Kenaana fapa Zedekia chuan thîr kîte a siamsak a, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘Hêngte hian Suria-hote chu boral dêr khawpin i si ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin zâwlnei zawng zawng chuan, “Ramoth-gilead-ah chuan han chho la, han hlawhtling rawh khai, Lalpan lal kutah hian a pe dâwn a ni,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia va ko tûra an tirha chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh khai, zâwlnei hian thukhat vuain a ṭha lamin lal hnênah thu an sawi ṭheuh va; an sawi tâk ṭheuh ang chuan han sawi ve la, a ṭha lamin han sawi ve rawh aw,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “ Lalpa nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, Lalpan ka hnêna a sawi chu a ni, ka han sawi dâwn ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, lal hnên a han thlen chuan, lal chuan a hnênah, “Mikai, Ramoth-gilead khua bei tûrin kan han thawk ang nge thawk lo vang?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Han thawk u la, han hlawhtling rawh u khai; Lalpan lal kutah a pe dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, lalin a hnênah, “Thutak ngawt lo chu ka hnênah Lalpa hminga sawi lo tûrin vawi eng zât nge maw chhia ka chhamtîr dâwn che le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Israel-ho zawng zawng chu vêngtu nei lo berâm angin tlângahte an darh vek ka hmu a; Lalpan , ‘Hêngho hian hotu an nei ta lo va, mi tin mahni in lamah thlamuang takin haw dial mai rawh se,’ a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Jehosaphata hnênah, “Ka chungchâng thu hi a chhe lam ngawt lo chu a ṭha lam rêng rêng zawng a sawi lo vang tih ka hrilh che a ni lâwm ni kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “Chuvângin, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh, Lalpa chu a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu ka hmu a, vâna mipuiho zawng zawng, a ding lam leh vei lama dingte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan , ‘Ahaba hi Ramoth-gilead khuaa han kala, râla thi tûrin tuin nge thlêm ang?’ a ti a. Pakhatin hetiang hian a ti a, mi dangin chutiang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, thlarau pakhat hi a lo chhuak a, Lalpa hmaah a ding a, ‘Keiman ka thlêm ang e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a hnênah, ‘Engin maw?’ a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, ‘Ka va kal ang a, zâwlnei zawng zawng hmuiah chuan thlarau dawtheiah ka va chang ang,’ a ti a. Tin, anin, ‘I thlêm ngei ang a, hlawh pawh i hlawhtling bawk ang; va kal ta la, chutiang chuan va ti tawh le,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngai teh, Lalpan hêng i zâwlneiho zawng zawng hmuiah hian thlarau dawthei a dah a, i chungchâng thu hi a ṭha lo lamin Lalpan a sawi tawh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Kenaana fapa Zedekia chuan a rawn hnaih a, Mikaia biangah a rawn bêng a, “ Lalpa thlarau chuan i hnêna thu sawi tûrin khawi lamah nge mi kalsan?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “Ngai rawh, pindan chhûngrila biru tûra i luh nîah i la hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan, “Mikaia hi hruai ula, khawpui awptu Amona leh lal fapa Joasa hnênah kalpui leh tawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tin, ‘Lalin heti hian a ti: “He mi hi lung inah khung ula, thlamuang taka ka lo haw leh hma loh chuan chaw leh tui tlêm tê chauh pe rawh u,” tiin,’ ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan, “Thlamuang taka i lo haw leh hrim chuan Lalpan kei mi hmangin thu a sawi lo a ni ang le,” a ti a. Tin, amah vêk chuan, “Nangni mipuite u, in vaiin lo hre rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel lal leh Juda lal Jehosaphata chu Ramoth-gilead khuaah chuan an han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal chuan Jehosaphata hnênah, “Ka inbâwl danglam ang a, inbeihnaah chuan ka han kal ve ang e; nang erawh chuan i lal puan sin ang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, Israel lal chu a inbâwl danglam a, inbeihnaah chuan a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Suria lal chuan a tawlailîr chunga hotu sawmthum leh pahnihte hnênah chuan, “Israel lal ngawt lo chu mi tê pawh, mi lian pawh a tua mah bei suh ang che u,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, tawlailîr chunga hotute chuan Jehosaphata an han hmuh chuan, heti hi a ni a, “Israel lal a ni ngei mai le!” an ti a. Tichuan, beih tumin an hual ta a; tin, Jehosaphata chu a au chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, tawlailîr chunga hotute chuan Israel lal a ni lo tih an hriat chuan heti hi a ni a, an ûm chu an lêt leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat hian tum bîk nei lovin a thal ngul a kuai a, Israel lal chu âwmphaw leh âwmphaw inkârah a kâp a; tichuan, a tawlailîr khalhtu hnênah, “Kai her la, sipaiho zîng ata hi mi chhuahpui rawh khai, hliam na tak ka tawh tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan inbeihna chu a nasa ta hle mai a; lal chu a tawlailîrah chuan Suria-hote hmuhah an dintîr a; tin, tlai lamah chuan a thi ta a. Tin, amah an hliamna aṭang chuan thisen chu tawlailîr chhûngah chuan a luang zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ni tlâk dâwn vêl lai chuan, sipaihote zîngah, “Mi tin mahni khaw lamah, mi tin mahni ram lamah haw vek tawh rawh se,” tiin an au vêl ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu a thi ta a, Samari khuaah an luhpui a; tichuan, Samari khuaah lal chu an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Samari khaw dîl kamah tawlailîr chu an sil a; tin, Lalpa thu sawi ang ngei khân uiin a thi te chu an liak ta a (chutah chuan nawhchizuarhote chu an insil ṭhîn).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Ahaba chanchin dang te, a thiltih zawng zawng te, a saingho in sak te, a khaw siam zawng zawngte chu Israel lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahaba chu a pute hnênah chuan a muhîl ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Ahazia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Israel lal Ahaba lal kum linaah Asa fapa Jehosaphata chu Juda-te chungah a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jehosaphata chu a lal ṭan lai chuan kum sawmthum leh kum nga a ni a; Jerusalem khuaah kum sawmhnih leh kum nga ro a rêl a. A nu hming chu Azubi, Silhia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a pa Asa kawng zawh zawng zawng chu a zawh ve a. Pênsan hauh lovin Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a. Hmun sângte erawh chu a thehthang bo lo va, hmun sângahte chuan mite chu an la inthawiin, rimtui an la hâl reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chuan Israel lal nêna inremna a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tichuan, Jehosaphata chanchin dang te, a thiltihtheihzia a tihlan thûte, a râl beih thûte chu Juda lalte lal lai thu ziakna buah a chuang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, a pa Asa dam laia mipa inzuarho la awmate kha a ram ata a hnawt chhuak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Edom ramah chuan lal an awm lo va, lal aiawhtuin ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jehosaphata chuan Ophir-a rangkachak phur tûr Tarsis lawngte a tu a; nimahsela, a kal ta lo, Ezion-geber hmunah lawngte chu a chhe ta vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tichuan, Ahaba fapa Ahazia chuan Jehosaphata hnênah, “Ka mite hi i mite nên lawngahte kal za ang hmiang,” a ti a. Nimahsela, Jehosaphata chuan a remti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Jehosaphata chu a pute hnênah a muhîl a, a pute zîngah a pu Davida khawpuiah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, a fapa Jehorama chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehosaphata lal kum sâwm leh kum sarih kumin, Ahaba fapa Ahazia chu Samari khuaah Israel-te chungah a lal ṭan a, Israel-te chungah kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa mit hmuhah thil ṭha lo a ti ṭhîn a, a nu leh a pa kawng zawh te, Nebata fapa Israel-hote tihsualtîrtu Jeroboama kawng zawhte a zawh ve ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, a pa tih ang apiang tiin Baala rawng a bâwl a, a be ṭhîn a, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu a tithinrim ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
